LL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ┘ê╪╣┘è╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘à╪╡╪▒ ╪د┘╪ص╪»┘è╪س╪ر ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë╪î ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪»╪î ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة╪î ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘à┘ ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪ر.\",\"en\":\"An all-in-one clinic management system for Misr Modern Center to manage patients, appointments, doctors, finance, and inventory from a single platform.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪╣┘è╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘à╪╡╪▒ ╪د┘╪ص╪»┘è╪س╪ر ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘ê┘è╪ذ ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ر ╪ذ╪┤┘â┘ ╪▒┘é┘à┘è ┘â╪د┘à┘. ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘è╪»╪╣┘à ╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر (╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒┘â╪▓╪î ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة╪î ┘ê┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ح╪┤╪▒╪د┘ ╪╣╪د┘à╪ر)╪î ┘ê┘è╪║╪╖┘è ╪»┘ê╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ┘à┘ ╪د╪│╪ز┘é╪ذ╪د┘ ╪د┘┘à╪▒┘è╪╢ ╪ص╪ز┘ë ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒╪î ┘à╪╣ ╪»╪╣┘à ╪ش┘╪│╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘╪د╪ش╪î ╪د┘╪ث╪┤╪╣╪ر╪î ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪ز╪ث┘à┘è┘╪î ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر.\",\"en\":\"Misr Modern Clinics is a web platform that digitizes the full operations of a medical center. It supports multiple roles (center admin, doctors, and a supervisory dashboard) and covers the workflow from patient intake to invoicing and reporting including treatment sessions, radiology, operations, insurance, and HR.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘â╪د┘╪ز ╪ز╪╣╪ز┘à╪» ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘ê╪▒┘é ╪ث┘ê ╪ث┘╪╕┘à╪ر ┘à╪ز┘╪▒┘é╪ر╪î ┘à┘à╪د ┘è╪│╪ذ╪ذ:\\r\\n╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë\\r\\n╪ز╪┤╪ز╪ز ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز\\r\\n╪╢╪╣┘ ╪د┘╪▒┘é╪د╪ذ╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪▒╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز\\r\\n╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪»┘é┘è┘é╪ر ┘ê┘╪ص╪╕┘è╪ر\\r\\n╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪│┘ê┘è┘é ┘┘è ┘à┘â╪د┘ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»\",\"en\":\"Medical centers were relying on paper processes or disconnected tools, which led to:\\r\\nDifficulty tracking appointments and patient records\\r\\nScattered doctor and service data\\r\\nWeak control over income and expenses\\r\\nLack of accurate, real-time reports\\r\\nNo unified way to manage inventory, staff, and marketing\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ذ┘╪د╪ة ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è ┘è┘ê╪ص┘ّ╪» ╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è ┘┘╪╣┘è╪د╪»╪ر: ┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë╪î ┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪»╪î ┘â╪┤┘╪î ┘ê╪╡┘╪ر╪î ┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر╪î ┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر╪î ┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘╪î ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘à╪╣ ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪»┘ê╪▒ ┘ê┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪ر ╪│┘ç┘╪ر ┘┘┘╪▒┘è┘é ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒┘è.\",\"en\":\"A centralized system that unifies daily clinic operations: patients, appointments, consultations, prescriptions, finance, HR, inventory, and reports with role-based access and a practical interface for medical and administrative teams.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪»\", \"en\": \"Patient & Appointment Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë\", \"en\": \"Patient registration and follow-up\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ص╪ش╪▓ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ┘ê╪╣╪▒╪╢┘ç╪د ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪ز┘é┘ê┘è┘à\", \"en\": \"Appointment booking with calendar view\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘â╪┤┘ ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪س ╪ص╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╣╪»\", \"en\": \"Consultation flow and appointment status updates\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘┘à╪▒┘è╪╢ ╪ذ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪د╪│╪ذ╪ر\", \"en\": \"Linking patients to the right doctor and service\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Doctor Portal\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪«╪د╪╡╪ر ╪ذ┘â┘ ╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ذ\", \"en\": \"Dedicated doctor dashboard\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪»\", \"en\": \"Patient and appointment tracking\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘â╪ز╪د╪ذ╪ر ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Digital prescriptions\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز╪┤╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Consultations and notifications\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘╪د╪ش\", \"en\": \"Medical Services & Treatment\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à┘é╪»┘à┘è ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر\", \"en\": \"Services and service providers management\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ش┘╪│╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘╪د╪ش ╪د┘┘â┘è┘à╪د┘ê┘è\", \"en\": \"Chemotherapy session tracking\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ش┘╪│╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪┤╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪╡┘ê┘è╪▒\", \"en\": \"Radiology and imaging sessions\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪┤┘┘è╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Operations and hospital management\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز╪ث┘à┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è\", \"en\": \"Medical insurance handling\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒\", \"en\": \"Finance & Billing\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ح╪╡╪»╪د╪▒ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒\", \"en\": \"Payments and invoice generation\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪┤┘ç╪▒┘è\", \"en\": \"Daily and monthly income reports\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Expense and commission reports\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ث╪ز╪╣╪د╪ذ ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Doctor fees tracking\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ\", \"en\": \"HR & Payroll\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Employee management\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘╪▓┘è╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪╡┘ê┘à╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Salaries, increases, and deductions\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ ╪د┘╪┤┘ç╪▒┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Monthly payroll reports\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ┘┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Roles and permissions system\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪▓┘à╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Supplies & Inventory\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘╪خ╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à╪د╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪▓┘à╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Supply categories and brands\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪┤╪▒╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘╪│╪ص╪ذ ┘à┘ ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘\", \"en\": \"Purchase invoices and stock withdrawals\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘┘ê╪د┘é╪╡\", \"en\": \"Inventory and shortage reports\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز╪│┘ê┘è┘é ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر\", \"en\": \"Marketing & Follow-up\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪ز┘à┘┘è┘ (Leads)\", \"en\": \"Leads management\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪╡╪د╪»╪▒ ╪د┘╪ز╪│┘ê┘è┘é\", \"en\": \"Marketing sources tracking\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é┘ê┘è┘à ╪د┘╪«╪د╪╡ ╪ذ╪د┘┘ Leads\", \"en\": \"Lead calendar and follow-ups\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪║┘è┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ص╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘╪د╪ص╪╕╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪│┘ç┘ê┘╪ر\", \"en\": \"Easy status and notes updates\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Reports & Notifications\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪┤╪د┘à┘╪ر ┘┘╪»╪«┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪»\", \"en\": \"Comprehensive income, expense, and appointment reports\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪»╪د╪«┘ ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à\", \"en\": \"In-system notifications\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪│╪ز┘è╪▒╪د╪» ┘ê╪ز╪╡╪»┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Data import and export\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪ر API ┘┘╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘à╪╣ ╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪ث╪«╪▒┘ë\", \"en\": \"API support for external integrations\"}]}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,20,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',11,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 03:01:21','2026-09-09 06:29:03',NULL),(17,'{\"ar\":\"╪د┘╪│┘ê╪د╪»┘è\",\"en\":\"Elsawady\"}','elsawady',NULL,NULL,NULL,'saas','{\"ar\":\"┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪د┘╪│┘ê╪د╪»┘è (EL-Sawady ERP) ┘à┘╪╡╪ر SaaS ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒┘è┘ ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▓╪د╪▒╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪د╪▒┘è╪╣ ╪د┘╪▓╪▒╪د╪╣┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ص┘è┘ê╪د┘┘è╪ر╪î ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪د┘╪ح┘╪ز╪د╪ش ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر ┘┘è ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪ر.\",\"en\":\"EL-Sawady ERP is a multi-tenant SaaS platform for managing farms and agribusiness operations, unifying production, inventory, sales, procurement, finance, HR, and e-commerce in a single dashboard.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪د┘╪│┘ê╪د╪»┘è ┘ç┘ê ╪ص┘ ERP ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪î ┘à╪╡┘à┘à ╪«╪╡┘è╪╡╪د┘ï ┘┘é╪╖╪د╪╣ ╪د┘╪▓╪▒╪د╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ز╪د╪ش ╪د┘╪ص┘è┘ê╪د┘┘è ┘┘è ╪د┘┘à┘╪╖┘é╪ر ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر. ┘è╪«╪»┘à ╪د┘┘à╪▓╪د╪▒╪╣╪î ╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح┘╪ز╪د╪ش ╪د┘╪▓╪▒╪د╪╣┘è╪î ┘à╪▓╪د╪▒╪╣ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪┤┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪»┘ê╪د╪ش┘╪î ┘ê╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪▓┘è╪╣ ╪د┘╪ز┘è ╪ز╪ص╪ز╪د╪ش ╪▒┘é╪د╪ذ╪ر ╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è╪ر ┘ê┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘à┘ ┘à┘â╪د┘ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪».\\r\\n\\r\\n╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘è╪╣┘à┘ ╪ذ┘┘à┘ê╪░╪ش SaaS ┘à╪╣ ╪╣╪▓┘ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘┘â┘ ┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒ (Multi-Tenant)╪î ┘ê╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â ┘é╪د╪ذ┘╪ر ┘┘╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡╪î ┘ê╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪»┘é┘è┘é╪ر ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪»┘ê╪▒ (RBAC). ┘è╪»╪╣┘à ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è╪ر ┘à╪╣ ┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪ر RTL╪î ┘ê┘è┘ê┘╪▒ REST API ┘╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪ذ╪د┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ش╪▒ ╪د┘╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪«╪د╪▒╪ش┘è╪ر.\",\"en\":\"EL-Sawady is a full-stack ERP solution, tailored for agriculture and livestock operations in the MENA region. It serves farms, agribusiness companies, livestock and poultry operations, and distribution companies that need operational and financial control from a single system.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe platform runs as a SaaS model with multi-tenant data isolation, customizable subscription plans, and role-based access control (RBAC). It supports Arabic and English with RTL UI, and exposes a REST API for mobile apps and external e-commerce frontends.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘à╪╣╪╕┘à ╪د┘┘à╪▓╪د╪▒╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪▓╪▒╪د╪╣┘è╪ر ╪ز╪╣╪ز┘à╪» ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪ز ┘à╪ز┘╪▒┘é╪ر Excel╪î ╪»┘╪د╪ز╪▒ ┘ê╪▒┘é┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د╪ز╪│╪د╪ذ ┘à┘à╪د ┘è╪ج╪»┘è ╪ح┘┘ë:\\r\\n\\r\\n╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘à╪┤╪ز╪ز╪ر ╪ذ╪»┘ê┘ ╪╡┘ê╪▒╪ر ┘à┘ê╪ص╪»╪ر ┘┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز\\r\\n╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪ز╪ز╪ذ╪╣ ╪»┘é┘è┘é ┘┘┘à┘ê╪د╪┤┘è: ╪ز╪╖╪╣┘è┘à╪د╪ز╪î ╪ز╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر╪î ╪ح┘╪ز╪د╪ش ┘╪ذ┘\\r\\n┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ╪║┘è╪▒ ┘à╪▒╪د┘é╪ذ ┘è┘┘╪د╪ش╪خ ╪د┘┘╪▒┘è┘é ╪ذ┘┘é╪╡ ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز\\r\\n┘╪╡┘ ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ظ¤> ╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘à╪╣╪▒┘╪ر ╪د┘╪▒╪ذ╪ص┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪ص┘é┘è┘é┘è╪ر\\r\\n╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪ر ┘┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ظ¤> ╪ث╪«╪╖╪د╪ة ┘┘è ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪ش╪د╪▓╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪ز╪ذ╪د╪ز\\r\\n┘à╪ز╪ش╪▒ ╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è ┘à┘┘╪╡┘ ╪║┘è╪▒ ┘à╪▒╪ذ┘ê╪╖ ╪ذ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ╪د┘┘╪╣┘┘è\\r\\n╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪│╪╣ ┘┘╪▒╪╣ ╪ش╪»┘è╪» ╪ث┘ê ╪╣┘à┘è┘ SaaS ╪ذ╪»┘ê┘ ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è\",\"en\":\"Most farms and agribusinesses rely on fragmented tools Excel, paper records, and messaging apps which leads to:\\r\\n\\r\\nScattered data with no unified operational view\\r\\nNo accurate livestock tracking for vaccinations, breeding, and milk production\\r\\nUnmonitored inventory that runs out without warning\\r\\nDisconnected procurement, sales, and accounting ظ¤> making real profitability hard to measure\\r\\nManual HR management ظ¤> errors in attendance, leave, and payroll\\r\\nStandalone e-commerce not linked to actual stock levels\\r\\nDifficulty scaling to new branches or SaaS customers without a centralized platform\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ذ┘┘ë ┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪د┘╪│┘ê╪د╪»┘è ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ERP ┘à┘ê╪ص╪»╪ر ╪ز╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘â┘ ╪»┘ê╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ┘à┘ ╪د┘╪ح┘╪ز╪د╪ش ╪ص╪ز┘ë ╪د┘┘╪د╪ز┘ê╪▒╪ر:\\r\\n\\r\\n┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è╪ر ┘┘â┘ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪»┘è┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘à┘ ╪د┘┘ê┘è╪ذ\\r\\n╪╣╪▓┘ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘┘â┘ ╪╣┘à┘è┘ (Multi-Tenant) ┘à╪╣ ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز\\r\\n╪ز┘╪ذ┘è┘ç╪د╪ز ╪░┘â┘è╪ر ┘┘╪ز╪╖╪╣┘è┘à╪د╪ز╪î ┘┘é╪╡ ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘╪î ╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪ة ┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘╪î ┘ê┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ╪د┘┘ê┘╪د╪»╪ر\\r\\n╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è ┘ê┘à╪د┘┘è ╪ز┘â╪د┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ص╪╕╪د╪خ╪▒╪î ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪د╪╡┘è┘╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪»┘ê╪د╪ش┘ ╪ز┘╪╣┘â╪│ ┘┘è ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ث╪▒╪ذ╪د╪ص ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪│╪د╪خ╪▒\\r\\n╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪»┘é┘è┘é╪ر ┘â┘ ┘à┘ê╪╕┘ ┘è╪▒┘ë ┘ê┘è┘╪»┘è╪▒ ┘à╪د ┘è╪«╪╡┘ç ┘┘é╪╖\\r\\n╪ز┘╪╣┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪»┘è┘ê┘╪د╪ز ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪ذ╪د┘é╪ر (Feature Gating) ┘┘à╪▒┘ê┘╪ر ┘┘è ╪د┘╪ز╪│╪╣┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣\\r\\nAPI ╪ش╪د┘ç╪▓ ┘┘╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪ذ╪د┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ش╪▒ ╪د┘╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر\",\"en\":\"EL-Sawady delivers a unified ERP platform that connects the full business cycle from production to invoicing:\\r\\n\\r\\nCentral dashboard for all modules via web\\r\\nPer-customer data isolation (Multi-Tenant) with subscription and plan management\\r\\nSmart alerts for vaccinations, low stock, employee document expiry, and expected deliveries\\r\\nOperationalظôfinancial linkage pen, crop, and poultry costs flow into profit & loss reports\\r\\nFine-grained permissions each user sees and manages only what they need\\r\\nPlan-based module activation (Feature Gating) for flexible pricing and sales\\r\\nReady REST API for mobile apps and e-commerce integration\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪┤┘è\", \"en\": \"Livestock Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪│╪ش┘ ╪ص┘è┘ê╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘â╪د┘à┘ (╪ث┘┘ê╪د╪╣╪î ╪│┘╪د┘╪د╪ز╪î ╪ص╪د┘╪د╪ز)\", \"en\": \"Full animal registry (species, breeds, statuses)\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ز╪║╪░┘è╪ر╪î ╪ح┘╪ز╪د╪ش ┘╪ذ┘╪î ╪ث┘ê╪▓╪د┘╪î ┘ê╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ╪╡╪ص┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Feeding, milk production, weight, and health records\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╖╪╣┘è┘à╪د╪ز ┘à╪╣ ┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ╪»┘╪╣╪د╪ز ┘┘é╪د╪ص╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Vaccinations with vaccine batch inventory\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪»┘ê╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ز╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر: ╪ز┘┘é┘è╪ص╪î ┘╪ص╪╡ ╪ص┘à┘╪î ┘ê┘╪د╪»╪ر\", \"en\": \"Breeding cycles: insemination, pregnancy check, birth\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘╪ذ┘è┘ç╪د╪ز: ╪ز╪╖╪╣┘è┘à ┘à╪│╪ز╪ص┘é / ┘à╪ز╪ث╪«╪▒ / ╪ص┘è┘ê╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪ز╪ص╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘╪د╪ش / ┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ┘ê┘╪د╪»╪ر ┘à╪ز┘ê┘é╪╣╪ر\", \"en\": \"Alerts: due/overdue vaccinations, animals under treatment, expected deliveries\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪▓╪د╪▒╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪╕╪د╪خ╪▒\", \"en\": \"Farms & Pens\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▓╪د╪▒╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪╕╪د╪خ╪▒\", \"en\": \"Farm and pen management\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘╪ص╪╕╪د╪خ╪▒ ╪ذ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪┤┘è ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ص╪د╪╡┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪»┘ê╪د╪ش┘\", \"en\": \"Link pens to livestock, crops, and poultry\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘é┘è┘ê╪» ┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘╪ص╪╕┘è╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪▒╪ذ╪ص┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Pen-level financial entries and profitability reports\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪»┘ê╪د╪ش┘\", \"en\": \"Poultry\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪»┘ê╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ز╪│┘à┘è┘ (Broiler Cycles)\", \"en\": \"Broiler cycles\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘é╪╖╪╣╪د┘ ╪ذ┘è╪د╪╢ (Layer Flocks)\", \"en\": \"Laye