d collection tracking\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Procurement\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘à┘ê╪▒╪»┘è┘ ┘ê╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪┤╪▒╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Suppliers and purchase requisitions\"}, {\"ar\": \"RFQ ┘ê╪╣╪▒┘ê╪╢ ╪ث╪│╪╣╪د╪▒\", \"en\": \"RFQs and quotations\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪┤╪▒╪د╪ة╪î ╪د╪│╪ز┘╪د┘à ╪ذ╪╢╪د╪╣╪ر╪î ┘ê┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Purchase orders, goods receipts, and purchase invoices\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪»┘ê╪▒╪ر ╪┤╪▒╪د╪ة ┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر\", \"en\": \"Full procurement cycle\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Finance\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪»┘┘è┘ ╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Chart of accounts\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘é┘è┘ê╪» ┘è┘ê┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪»┘╪ز╪▒ ╪ث╪│╪ز╪د╪░\", \"en\": \"Journal entries and general ledger\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Expenses\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ث╪▒╪ذ╪د╪ص ┘ê╪«╪│╪د╪خ╪▒\", \"en\": \"Profit & loss reports\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Human Resources\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à╪î ┘à╪│┘à┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪╕┘è┘┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Departments, job titles, and employees\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪ز┘╪ذ┘è┘ç╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Employee documents with expiry alerts\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡╪▒╪د┘\", \"en\": \"Attendance (check-in / check-out)\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪ح╪ش╪د╪▓╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à┘ê╪د┘┘é╪ر/╪▒┘╪╢\", \"en\": \"Leave requests with approval/rejection\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"E-Commerce\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪ش╪▒ ┘à┘ ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘â┘à\", \"en\": \"Order management from the dashboard\"}, {\"ar\": \"API ┘┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪│┘╪ر╪î ╪د┘┘à┘╪╢┘╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"API for products, cart, favorites, and orders\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ص┘╪╕╪ر ╪▒┘é┘à┘è╪ر (Wallet)\", \"en\": \"Digital wallet\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒\", \"en\": \"Orders linked to inventory and tenant\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘┘è┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Analytics\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘┘è┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Analytics dashboard\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Operational reports\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"Super Admin\", \"en\": \"Super Admin\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز (Plans) ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘è╪▓╪د╪ز (Features)\", \"en\": \"Plans and features management\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة: ╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة╪î ╪ز╪ش╪»┘è╪»╪î ╪ز╪▒┘é┘è╪ر╪î ╪ح┘╪║╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Customer subscriptions: create, renew, upgrade, cancel\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à╪ص╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر (┘à┘é╪د┘╪د╪ز╪î ┘┘è╪»┘è┘ê┘ç╪د╪ز╪î ╪╡┘╪ص╪د╪ز)\", \"en\": \"Platform content (articles, videos, pages)\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪»┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»┘\", \"en\": \"Countries and cities management\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘à┘è╪▓╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر\", \"en\": \"Platform Features\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"Multi-Tenant (╪╣╪▓┘ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘┘â┘ ╪╣┘à┘è┘)\", \"en\": \"Multi-Tenant (isolated data per customer)\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز SaaS ┘ê╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ┘é╪د╪ذ┘╪ر ┘┘╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡\", \"en\": \"SaaS subscriptions with customizable plans\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ (RBAC)\", \"en\": \"Role-based access control (RBAC)\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è / ╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è + ╪»╪╣┘à RTL\", \"en\": \"Arabic / English + RTL support\"}, {\"ar\": \"REST API\", \"en\": \"REST API\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪»╪«┘ê┘ ╪د╪ش╪ز┘à╪د╪╣┘è (Social Auth)\", \"en\": \"Social authentication\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ذ╪ص╪س ╪╣╪د┘à (Global Search)\", \"en\": \"Global search\"}]}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 08:42:37','2026-09-02 09:27:57',NULL),(18,'{\"ar\":\"╪ح╪┤╪د╪▒╪ذ\",\"en\":\"Esharb\"}','esharb',NULL,NULL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"╪ح╪┤╪د╪▒╪ذ ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘â╪ز╪د┘┘ê╪ش ╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è ╪س┘╪د╪خ┘è╪ر ╪د┘┘╪║╪ر (╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è\\/╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è) ┘╪╣╪▒╪╢ ┘ê╪ذ┘è╪╣ ╪د┘╪ص╪ش╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘ê╪┤╪ص╪ر ╪د┘┘╪د╪«╪▒╪ر╪î ┘à╪╣ ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ API ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز┘╪│╪د╪▒╪د╪ز.\",\"en\":\"Esharb is a bilingual (Arabic\\/English) e-commerce catalog platform for premium hijabs and scarves, with an API-powered admin backend for products, inventory, and customer inquiries.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ح╪┤╪د╪▒╪ذ ┘ç┘ê ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘╪╣╪▒╪╢ ┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪▓┘è╪د╪ة ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪ز╪┤┘à╪ر (╪ص╪ش╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز╪î ╪ث┘ê╪┤╪ص╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ح┘â╪│╪│┘ê╪د╪▒╪د╪ز) ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ ┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪ر ┘à╪ز╪ش╪▒ ╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è ╪╣╪╡╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪│╪▒┘è╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز╪ش╪د╪ذ╪ر\\r\\n\\r\\n╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪╡┘à┘à╪ر ╪«╪╡┘è╪╡╪د┘ï ┘┘╪│┘ê┘é ╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è: ╪»╪╣┘à ┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘┘╪║╪ر ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د╪ز╪ش╪د┘ç RTL╪î ╪ز╪│╪╣┘è╪▒ ╪ذ╪د┘╪ش┘┘è┘ç ╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘è╪î ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘à╪ذ╪د╪┤╪▒ ┘à╪╣ ┘ê╪د╪ز╪│╪د╪ذ ┘╪ز╪ص┘ê┘è┘ ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز┘╪│╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ح┘┘ë ┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز. ╪ز╪ز┘è╪ص ┘┘╪╣┘à┘è┘ ╪ز╪╡┘╪ص ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪د┘à╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪│╪╣╪▒╪î ┘à╪╣ ╪╡┘╪ص╪د╪ز ┘à┘╪ز╪ش ╪║┘┘è╪ر ╪ذ╪د┘╪╡┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ز╪║┘è╪▒╪د╪ز (Variants)╪î ╪ذ┘è┘┘à╪د ┘è╪»┘è╪▒ ┘╪▒┘è┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ┘â┘ ╪┤┘è╪ة ┘à┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ذ┘╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪ص╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪س╪د╪ذ╪ز╪ر ┘ê╪ص╪ز┘ë ╪ز╪ز╪ذ╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز.\",\"en\":\"Esharb is an end-to-end catalog system for modest fashion products (hijabs, scarves, and accessories), combining a modern, responsive storefront\\r\\n\\r\\nBuilt for the Egyptian and MENA market, the platform offers full Arabic\\/RTL support, EGP pricing, and direct WhatsApp integration to turn inquiries into sales. Customers can browse products by category, material, color, and price, with rich product pages featuring image galleries and color variants. The operations team manages everything from products and banners to static pages, inventory tracking, and role-based access control.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘â╪س┘è╪▒ ┘à┘ ┘à╪ز╪د╪ش╪▒ ╪د┘╪ص╪ش╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘ê╪┤╪ص╪ر ┘┘è ╪د┘┘à┘╪╖┘é╪ر ╪ز╪╣╪ز┘à╪» ╪╣┘┘ë ┘┘è╪│╪ذ┘ê┘â ┘ê╪ح┘╪│╪ز╪║╪▒╪د┘à ┘ê┘ê╪د╪ز╪│╪د╪ذ ┘┘é╪╖╪î ╪ذ╪»┘ê┘ ┘à┘ê┘é╪╣ ╪د╪ص╪ز╪▒╪د┘┘è ┘è╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪┤┘â┘ ┘à┘╪╕┘à. ┘ç╪░╪د ┘è╪ج╪»┘è ╪ح┘┘ë:\\r\\n\\r\\n╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪ث┘┘ê╪د┘┘ç╪د ┘ê╪«╪د┘à╪د╪ز┘ç╪د ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر\\r\\n┘┘é╪»╪د┘ ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز┘╪│╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪د┘╪▒╪│╪د╪خ┘ ╪╣┘┘ë ┘ê╪│╪د╪خ┘ ╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘\\r\\n╪╣╪»┘à ┘ê╪ش┘ê╪» ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ╪ث┘ê ╪ز╪ز╪ذ╪╣ ┘┘┘â┘à┘è╪د╪ز\\r\\n╪╢╪╣┘ ╪د┘╪╕┘ç┘ê╪▒ ┘┘è ┘à╪ص╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ذ╪ص╪س (SEO)\\r\\n╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪ذ┘╪║╪ز┘è┘ (╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è ┘ê╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è)\\r\\n╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د╪╢╪ص╪ر ┘┘╪▒┘è┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘\",\"en\":\"Many hijab and scarf retailers in the region rely solely on Facebook, Instagram, and WhatsApp, without a professional website to showcase products systematically. This leads to:\\r\\n\\r\\nDifficulty displaying products with multiple colors and materials\\r\\nLost inquiries scattered across social media messages\\r\\nNo inventory system or stock tracking\\r\\nPoor search engine visibility (SEO)\\r\\nChallenges managing bilingual content (Arabic & English)\\r\\nNo clear role-based access for team members\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ذ┘┘è┘╪د ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪ح╪┤╪د╪▒╪ذ ┘â╪ص┘ ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘è╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪ذ┘è┘:\\r\\n\\r\\n┘à╪ز╪ش╪▒ ╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è ╪ث┘┘è┘é ╪ذ╪ز╪╡┘à┘è┘à ╪╣╪╡╪▒┘è ┘è╪╣┘â╪│ ┘ç┘ê┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘╪د┘à╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪▒┘è╪ر ╪د┘┘╪د╪«╪▒╪ر\\r\\n┘â╪ز╪د┘┘ê╪ش ┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ╪░┘â┘è ┘à╪╣ ┘à╪ز╪║┘è╪▒╪د╪ز (╪ث┘┘ê╪د┘╪î ╪ث╪│╪╣╪د╪▒╪î ╪╡┘ê╪▒) ┘ê╪ز╪╡┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ذ╪ص╪س ┘à╪ز┘é╪»┘à\\r\\n╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘ê╪د╪ز╪│╪د╪ذ ┘╪ح╪▒╪│╪د┘ ╪د╪│╪ز┘╪│╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ش╪د┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪ز┘┘é╪د╪خ┘è╪د┘ï ┘à╪╣ ╪ز┘╪د╪╡┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش\\r\\n┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر API ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪ذ┘╪▒╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪╡┘╪ص╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪ث╪│╪خ┘╪ر ╪د┘╪┤╪د╪خ╪╣╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪»╪د╪ز\\r\\n┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘╪ز╪ز╪ذ╪╣ ╪د┘┘â┘à┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ص╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘\\r\\n╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ (Super Admin \\/ Admin) ┘╪ص┘à╪د┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز\\r\\n╪ز╪ص╪│┘è┘ SEO ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ Sitemap ┘êMeta Tags ┘êStructured Data\",\"en\":\"We built Esharb as an integrated solution combining:\\r\\n\\r\\nAn elegant e-commerce storefront with a modern design reflecting a premium brand identity\\r\\nA smart product catalog with variants (colors, prices, images), advanced filtering, and search\\r\\nWhatsApp integration for auto-generated product inquiries with full details\\r\\nAn API-powered admin panel to manage products, categories, banners, pages, FAQs, and settings\\r\\nInventory management for stock quantities and movement tracking\\r\\nRole-based permissions (Super Admin \\/ Admin) to secure operations\\r\\nSEO optimization via Sitemap, Meta Tags, and Structured Data\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪ش╪▒\", \"en\": \"Storefront\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪ر ╪س┘╪د╪خ┘è╪ر ╪د┘┘╪║╪ر (╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è/╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è) ┘à╪╣ ╪»╪╣┘à RTL\", \"en\": \"Bilingual interface (Arabic/English) with RTL support\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╡┘╪ص╪ر ╪▒╪خ┘è╪│┘è╪ر ┘à╪╣ ╪ذ┘╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ┘à┘à┘è╪▓╪ر ┘ê┘ê╪╡┘ ╪ص╪»┘è╪س╪د┘ï ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘â╪س╪▒ ┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د┘ï\", \"en\": \"Homepage with banners, featured, new arrivals & best sellers\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘â╪ز╪د┘┘ê╪ش ┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ┘à╪╣ ╪ز╪╡┘┘è╪ر (╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘╪î ╪«╪د┘à╪ر╪î ┘┘ê┘╪î ╪│╪╣╪▒╪î ╪ز┘ê┘╪▒) ┘ê╪ز╪▒╪ز┘è╪ذ\", \"en\": \"Product catalog with filters (category, material, color, price, availability) & sorting\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╡┘╪ص╪ر ┘à┘╪ز╪ش ┘à╪╣ ┘à╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪╡┘ê╪▒╪î ╪د╪«╪ز┘è╪د╪▒ ╪د┘┘┘ê┘╪î ┘ê┘à╪ز╪║┘è╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪│╪╣╪▒\", \"en\": \"Product page with image gallery, color picker & price variants\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ┘à╪╣ ╪╡┘╪ص╪د╪ز ┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر\", \"en\": \"Product categories with dedicated pages\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ذ╪ص╪س ┘à╪ز┘é╪»┘à ┘┘è ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Advanced search across products & categories\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪│╪ز┘╪│╪د╪▒ ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ ┘ê╪د╪ز╪│╪د╪ذ ╪ذ╪▒╪│╪د┘╪ر ╪ش╪د┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪ز┘┘é╪د╪خ┘è╪د┘ï\", \"en\": \"WhatsApp inquiry with auto-generated message\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘┘à┘ê╪░╪ش ╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪ز╪ز╪ذ╪╣ ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز┘╪│╪د╪▒╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Contact form with 