┘ê╪ذ\", \"en\": \"Agent Portal\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ╪«╪د╪╡╪ر\", \"en\": \"Dedicated dashboard\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ص╪ش┘ê╪▓╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Booking tracking\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Commission tracking\"}]}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 19:55:43','2026-09-02 19:55:45',NULL),(20,'{\"ar\":\"SportHub ظ¤ ┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث┘╪»┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ╪د┘╪▒┘è╪د╪╢┘è╪ر\",\"en\":\"SportHub ظ¤ Sports Club & Fitness Center Management System\"}','sporthub-sports-club-fitness-center-management-system',NULL,NULL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث┘╪»┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ╪د┘╪▒┘è╪د╪╢┘è╪ر╪î ┘è╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘à╪╣ ╪د┘╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪ث╪ش┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪╣╪▒┘ّ┘ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘ê╪ش┘ç╪î ┘╪ز╪│┘ç┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è ┘ê╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘ ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒.\",\"en\":\"An integrated management system for sports clubs and fitness centers, combining member, subscription, and payment management with facial recognition device integration to simplify daily operations, manage access, and track attendance.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪╖┘ê┘ّ╪▒┘╪د ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪▒┘é┘à┘è╪ر ╪ز┘ê╪ص┘ّ╪» ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è╪ر ┘┘╪ث┘╪»┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ╪د┘╪▒┘è╪د╪╢┘è╪ر ┘┘è ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ╪ز╪»╪╣┘à ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è╪ر. ╪ز╪ز┘è╪ص ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪ذ┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à╪î ┘ê╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â ┘ê┘à╪»╪»┘ç╪د ┘ê╪ز╪ش┘à┘è╪»┘ç╪د ┘ê╪ز┘à╪»┘è╪»┘ç╪د╪î ╪ح┘┘ë ╪ش╪د┘╪ذ ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘ê╪ز╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪╣ ╪ث╪ش┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪╣╪▒┘ّ┘ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘ê╪ش┘ç ┘╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘ ╪ذ╪ص╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â ┘ê╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ث╪ص╪»╪د╪س ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘╪î ┘à╪╣ ╪ز┘é╪»┘è┘à ┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ┘┘╪د╪▓╪»╪ص╪د┘à ╪ذ┘╪د╪ة┘ï ╪╣┘┘ë ╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ص╪▒┘â╪ر. ┘â┘à╪د ╪ز╪ز╪╢┘à┘ ┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪▒┘à╪ش┘è╪ر ┘╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘╪î ╪ز╪┤┘à┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘╪î ┘ê╪د╪│╪ز╪╣╪▒╪د╪╢ ╪د┘╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪▒┘╪╣ ╪ح┘è╪╡╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘ê┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ذ┘┘â┘è╪î ┘ê╪د╪│╪ز┘é╪ذ╪د┘ ╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز.\",\"en\":\"We developed a digital platform that brings the administrative and operational workflows of sports clubs and fitness centers into a centralized dashboard supporting Arabic and English. The platform manages members, trainers, and facility sections, alongside subscription plans, pricing, durations, freezes, reactivation, and extensions. It also supports payment, transaction, and invoice tracking.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe platform integrates with facial recognition devices to connect access permissions with subscription status and record entry events. It provides traffic indicators based on access logs and includes APIs for member services such as registration, browsing plans and subscriptions, uploading bank transfer receipts, and receiving notifications.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ز┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç ╪د┘╪ث┘╪»┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ╪د┘╪▒┘è╪د╪╢┘è╪ر ╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘┘è ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ╪╣┘╪»┘à╪د ╪ز╪ز┘ê╪▓╪╣ ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ث┘╪╕┘à╪ر ┘à┘┘╪╡┘╪ر. ┘ê┘è╪▓┘è╪» ┘╪╡┘ ╪ث╪ش┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘ ╪╣┘ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â ┘à┘ ╪╣╪ذ╪ة ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘é┘é ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘╪î ┘ê┘è╪╡╪╣┘ّ╪ذ ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز┘ç┘è╪ر ╪ث┘ê ╪د┘┘à╪ش┘à┘ّ╪»╪ر. ┘â╪░┘┘â╪î ┘è╪ص╪» ╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪ش┘à┘ّ╪╣╪ر ┘à┘ ┘ê╪╢┘ê╪ص ╪ث┘ê┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪░╪▒┘ê╪ر ┘ê┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح┘é╪ذ╪د┘ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à.\",\"en\":\"Sports clubs and fitness centers face operational challenges when member records, subscriptions, and payments are spread across manual records and disconnected systems. Managing entry devices separately from subscription data adds verification work for staff and makes expired or frozen memberships harder to monitor. Without consolidated attendance data, managers also have limited visibility into peak hours and activity across facility sections.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪│╪د╪│┘è╪ر ┘┘è ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪ر╪î ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘ê╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز┘ç┘à ┘ê┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز┘ç┘à ╪ذ╪ث╪ش┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘. ┘è╪ز┘è╪ص ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪س ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê┘┘é┘ï╪د ┘╪ص╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪î ┘ê╪ز┘ê╪س┘è┘é ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒╪î ┘ê┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪╣╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘à┘ ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è╪ر. ┘ê╪ز╪│╪د╪╣╪» ┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ص╪▒┘â╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ╪د┘╪▒┘é┘à┘è╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ز╪│┘ç┘è┘ ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘╪د╪»┘è ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪│┘è┘ ╪ز╪ش╪▒╪ذ╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â.\",\"en\":\"A centralized platform that connects member records, subscriptions, and payments with entry devices. The system updates access permissions according to subscription status, records attendance, and brings financial transaction reviews into one dashboard. Traffic indicators, notifications, and digital member services help reduce manual follow-up, simplify club operations, and improve the member experience.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪ذ┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Member and Trainer Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪س ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘ê╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز┘ç┘à ╪د┘╪┤╪«╪╡┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Create and update member profiles and personal details.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ┘â┘ ┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â.\", \"en\": \"Track each memberظآs subscriptions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪ذ┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Manage trainer records.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪│╪ز┘è╪▒╪د╪» ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘à┘ ╪د┘┘à┘┘╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Import member data from files.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ┘ê╪د┘╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Sections, Plans, and Subscriptions\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ╪د┘╪▒┘è╪د╪╢┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Create and manage sports sections.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪د┘╪ث╪│╪╣╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»╪».\", \"en\": \"Configure subscription plans, pricing, and durations.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ش┘à┘è╪» ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ح╪╣╪د╪»╪ر ╪ز┘╪╣┘è┘┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Freeze and reactivate subscriptions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘à╪»┘è╪» ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ز┘ê╪د╪▒┘è╪« ╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪خ┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Extend subscriptions and track expiration dates.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪ث╪ش┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘\", \"en\": \"Access Device Integration\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘à╪╣ ╪ث╪ش┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪╣╪▒┘ّ┘ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘ê╪ش┘ç.\", \"en\": \"Integrate with facial recognition devices.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ╪ذ╪ث╪ش┘ç╪▓╪ر ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘ ┘ê┘à╪▓╪د┘à┘╪ر ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز┘ç┘à.\", \"en\": \"Assign members to entry devices and synchronize their data.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪س ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘ ┘ê┘┘é┘ï╪د ┘╪ص╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â.\", \"en\": \"Update access permissions according to subscription status.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡ ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘┘é╪│┘à ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪ز╪ذ╪╖ ╪ذ╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â.\", \"en\": \"Manage access based on the section associated with each subscription.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د╪▓╪»╪ص╪د┘à\", \"en\": \"Attendance and Traffic Insights\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ث╪ص╪»╪د╪س ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘ ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒.\", \"en\": \"Record entry events and review attendance logs.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪ح╪ص╪╡╪د╪خ┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪▒╪│┘ê┘à ╪ذ┘è╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒.\", \"en\": \"View attendance statistics and charts.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ص╪▒┘â╪ر ╪د┘╪»╪«┘ê┘ ┘┘â┘ ┘é╪│┘à.\", \"en\": \"Monitor entry activity indicators for each section.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪د┘┘╪ز╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث┘â╪س╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘é┘ ╪د╪▓╪»╪ص╪د┘à┘ï╪د ╪ذ┘╪د╪ة┘ï ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Identify busier and quieter periods based on recorded activity.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒\", \"en\": \"Financial Management and Invoices\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ذ╪د┘╪║ ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪ذ┘é┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Track payments and outstanding balances.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪│╪د╪خ┘ ╪د┘╪»┘╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage payment methods and financial transactions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪│╪ز┘é╪ذ╪د┘ ╪ح┘è╪╡╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘ê┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ذ┘┘â┘è ┘ê┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ز┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Receive and review bank transfer receipts.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪╣╪ز┘à╪د╪» ╪د┘┘à╪╣╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز ╪ث┘ê ╪▒┘╪╢┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Approve or reject transactions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪╖╪ذ╪د╪╣╪ز┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"View and print invoices.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Member Communication\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘é┘ê╪د┘╪ذ ╪د┘╪▒╪│╪د╪خ┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪▒╪ص┘è╪ذ┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage welcome message templates.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪▒╪│╪د┘ ╪د┘╪▒╪│╪د╪خ┘ ┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ┘à╪ص╪»╪»┘è┘ ╪ث┘ê ┘┘╪ش┘à┘è╪╣.\", \"en\": \"Send messages to selected members or all members.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪│╪ش┘ ╪ح╪▒╪│╪د┘ ╪د┘╪▒╪│╪د╪خ┘.\", \"en\": \"Review message delivery records.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê┘┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ص╪د┘╪ر ┘é╪▒╪د╪ة╪ز┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Provide notifications and track read status.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Administration and Permissions\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ج┘ê┘┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Manage administrator accounts.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘.\", \"en\": \"Create roles and configure access permissions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ز╪ذ┘ّ╪╣ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒┘è╪ر ┘à┘ ╪«┘╪د┘ ╪│╪ش┘ ╪د┘┘╪┤╪د╪╖.\", \"en\": \"Track administrative actions through activity logs.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡ ╪د┘╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣╪د┘à╪ر ┘┘┘╪╕╪د┘à.\", \"en\": \"Customize general system settings.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪»╪╣┘à ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Support Arabic and English.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘â┘è┘ ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ ╪د┘┘ API\", \"en\": \"Member Services via API\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘é┘é ╪ذ╪د╪│╪ز╪«╪»╪د┘à ╪▒┘à╪▓ OTP.\", \"en\": \"Register and verify accounts using OTP.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘┘ ╪د┘╪┤╪«╪╡┘è ┘ê╪د╪│╪ز╪╣╪د╪»╪ر ┘â┘┘à╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒┘ê╪▒.\", \"en\": \"Manage profiles and reset passwords.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪│╪ز╪╣╪▒╪د╪╢ ╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ┘ê╪د┘╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Browse sections, plans, and subscriptions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒┘╪╣ ╪ح┘è╪╡╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘ê┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ذ┘┘â┘è.\", \"en\": \"Upload bank transfer receipts.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪د╪╖┘╪د╪╣ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪▒╪│╪د╪خ┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪▒╪ص┘è╪ذ┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Access notifications and welcome messages.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪│╪ز╪╣╪▒╪د╪╢ ┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د╪▓╪»╪ص╪د┘à ╪د┘┘╪د╪»┘è.\", \"en\": \"View club traffic indicators.\"}]}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-05 06:05:33','2026-09-05 06:30:37',NULL),(21,'{\"ar\":\"╪ح╪│╪ز┘è╪ز ┘┘┘ê - ┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘à┘╪د┘â\",\"en\":\"EstateFlow - Property & Asset Management\"}','estateflow-property-asset-management',NULL,NULL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘à┘╪د┘â╪î ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ┘┘è ┘à┘â╪د┘ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪î ┘╪ز╪ذ╪│┘è╪╖ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪│┘è┘ ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪ص┘╪╕╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪ر.\",\"en\":\"┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘à┘╪د┘â╪î ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒┘è┘ ┘