à ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘à┘╪╕┘à╪ر ┘┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒┘è┘╪î ┘ê╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪ز ┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ┘ê╪د┘╪»┘╪╣╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ╪ز┘ê╪╢╪ص ╪د┘┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪│╪د╪│┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ┘ê╪د┘┘ê┘â╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز┘è ╪ز┘é╪ز╪▒╪ذ ┘à┘ ╪د┘╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪ة.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘è╪│╪د╪╣╪» ┘ç╪░╪د ╪د┘╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ┘╪▒┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ز╪│┘ç┘è┘ ┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪د╪ز╪«╪د╪░ ┘é╪▒╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ز╪│╪ز┘╪» ╪ح┘┘ë ┘à╪╣┘┘ê┘à╪د╪ز ┘à┘ê╪ص╪»╪ر.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Property & Unit Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪▒╪د╪╢┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪┤┘é┘é ┘ê╪د┘┘┘┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘ê╪»╪╣╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Manage land, apartments, villas, commercial properties, and warehouses.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à┘ê┘é╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪د╪ص╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪»┘ê╪» ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘╪د╪╡┘è┘ ╪د┘╪«╪د╪╡╪ر ╪ذ┘â┘ ╪╣┘é╪د╪▒.\", \"en\": \"Record property locations, areas, boundaries, and specific details.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪ش╪د╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖┘ç╪د ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Organize rental units and link them to properties.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╢╪د┘╪ر ╪╡┘ê╪▒ ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ص╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Add property and unit images and track their status.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ذ╪ص╪س ╪╣┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ز╪╡┘┘è╪ز┘ç╪د ╪ذ┘à╪╣╪د┘è┘è╪▒ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Search and filter properties using multiple criteria.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Owner & Tenant Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘┘┘à┘╪د┘â ╪ز╪ز╪╢┘à┘ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Maintain owner profiles with contact details and documents.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪╣╪»╪ر ┘à┘╪د┘â ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ┘╪│╪ذ ┘ê╪ص╪╡╪╡ ╪د┘┘à┘┘â┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Link multiple owners to a property and define ownership percentages and shares.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪ز╪ذ╪╖╪ر ╪ذ╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â.\", \"en\": \"Record owner-related commissions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒┘è┘ ┘ê┘à┘à╪س┘┘è┘ç┘à ┘ê┘à╪▒┘┘é╪د╪ز┘ç┘à.\", \"en\": \"Manage tenants, their representatives, and supporting attachments.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ث╪ش╪▒┘è┘ ╪ذ╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ╪د┘╪«╪د╪╡╪ر ╪ذ┘ç┘à.\", \"en\": \"Connect tenants with their units and contracts.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣╪▒┘ê╪╢ ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪»\", \"en\": \"Offer & Contract Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╣╪▒┘ê╪╢ ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖┘ç╪د ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Record offers and link them to properties.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪ش╪د╪▒┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage property and rental unit contracts.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ز┘╪د╪╡┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ┘ê┘à╪»╪»┘ç╪د ┘ê┘à╪▒┘┘é╪د╪ز┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Maintain contract details, terms, and attachments.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ╪د┘╪ز┘è ╪ز┘é╪ز╪▒╪ذ ┘à┘ ╪د┘╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪ة ╪«┘╪د┘ 30 ┘ê60 ┘ê90 ┘è┘ê┘à┘ï╪د.\", \"en\": \"Track contracts expiring within 30, 60, and 90 days.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Financial & Payment Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ش╪»╪د┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪│╪»╪د╪» ┘ê╪د┘╪»┘╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪ش╪د╪▒┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage payment schedules and rental payments.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪╖╪▒┘é ╪د┘╪»┘╪╣ ┘ê╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ذ┘┘â.\", \"en\": \"Record invoices, payment methods, and bank details.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪▒┘╪د┘é ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘è╪╡╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪د┘╪»┘╪╣╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Attach supporting documents and receipts to payments.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪▒╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ┘â╪┤┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ.\", \"en\": \"Record income and expenses and prepare account statements.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê╪س┘è┘é ╪ز┘ê╪▓┘è╪╣ ╪د┘╪»┘╪╣╪د╪ز ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â.\", \"en\": \"Document payment distributions to owners.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪س╪د╪خ┘é\", \"en\": \"Document Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ص┘╪╕ ╪د┘╪╡┘â┘ê┘â ┘ê╪د┘┘ê┘â╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖┘ç╪د ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â.\", \"en\": \"Store title deeds and powers of attorney linked to properties and owners.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪▒╪«╪╡ ╪د┘╪ذ┘╪د╪ة ┘ê┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪»┘╪د╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘è.\", \"en\": \"Maintain building permits and civil defense documents.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒┘╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪«╪╖╪╖╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒┘┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Upload and categorize drawings, images, and attachments.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘ê┘â╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز┘è ╪ز┘é╪ز╪▒╪ذ ┘à┘ ╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪ة ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪ز┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Track upcoming power of attorney expirations.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪د╪▒┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Maintenance & Expense Tracking\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘ ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪│┘┘ê┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Record annual maintenance activities.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê╪س┘è┘é ╪ز┘â╪د┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘╪ز╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪«╪د╪╡╪ر ╪ذ┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Document maintenance costs and associated periods.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪▒┘╪د┘é ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪»╪د╪╣┘à╪ر ┘┘â┘ ╪│╪ش┘.\", \"en\": \"Attach supporting documents to each record.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒ ┘╪ز╪│┘ç┘è┘ ┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز┘ç.\", \"en\": \"Link maintenance records to properties for easier expense review.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒\", \"en\": \"Dashboard & Reporting\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ┘à┘╪«╪╡╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘╪د┘â ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪س╪د╪خ┘é.\", \"en\": \"View summaries of properties, owners, and documents.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪» ┘ê╪د┘┘ê┘â╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘é╪▒┘è╪ذ╪ر ┘à┘ ╪د┘╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪ة.\", \"en\": \"Monitor upcoming contract and power of attorney expirations.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘è╪ش╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪┤╪د╪║╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘ç╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪╣┘é┘ê╪».\", \"en\": \"Access asset, rental, vacancy, and lease expiry reports.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╡╪»┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪»╪╣┘ê┘à╪ر ╪ح┘┘ë Excel ┘êPDF.\", \"en\": \"Export supported data and reports to Excel and PDF.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ┘ê┘à╪▒┘ê┘╪ر ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"User Management & Data Flexibility\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ┘ê╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز┘ç┘à.\", \"en\": \"Manage user accounts and profile details.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪║┘è┘è╪▒╪د╪ز ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ┘╪ز╪│┘ç┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Track record changes through an audit trail.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪»┘ê┘╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪»┘è┘╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ص┘è.\", \"en\": \"Organize locations by country, city, and neighborhood.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪«╪ز┘è╪د╪▒ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ح╪»╪«╪د┘ ╪د┘╪ث╪│┘à╪د╪ة ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Select currencies and enter names in Arabic and English.\"}]}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-05 06:30:09','2026-09-05 06:30:10',NULL),(22,'{\"ar\":\"╪│┘â┘ê┘┘è┘╪د\",\"en\":\"Schoolina\"}','schoolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"╪│┘â┘ê┘┘è┘╪د ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│╪î ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث┘â╪د╪»┘è┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è╪ر ┘┘è ┘à┘â╪د┘ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪î ┘ê╪ز╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘à┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪ث┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث┘à┘ê╪▒ ┘╪ز╪│┘ç┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪╣┘┘è┘à┘è╪ر.\",\"en\":\"Schoolina is an integrated school management platform that brings academic, financial, and operational processes together, connecting administrators, teachers, students, and parents to simplify daily work and support educational oversight.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪│┘â┘ê┘┘è┘╪د ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ش┘à┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪╣┘┘è┘à┘è╪ر╪î ┘è╪║╪╖┘è ╪▒╪ص┘╪ر ╪د┘╪╖╪د┘╪ذ ┘à┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à┘┘┘ç ╪ح┘┘ë ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪د╪ش╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪«╪ز╪ذ╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘╪ز╪د╪خ╪ش. ┘ê┘è╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪▒╪│┘ê┘à ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘┘é┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘┘é ╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪│┘è╪ر ╪╢┘à┘ ╪ذ┘è╪خ╪ر ┘à┘ê╪ص╪»╪ر.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘è┘ê┘╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╣ ╪ذ┘ê╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر ┘┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘à┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪ث┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث┘à┘ê╪▒╪î ┘à╪╣ ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ز╪│╪د╪╣╪» ┘â┘ ┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à ╪╣┘┘ë ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘à╪│╪ج┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ز┘ç. ┘â┘à╪د ┘è╪»╪╣┘à ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر╪î ╪ذ┘à╪د ┘è╪ز┘è╪ص ┘┘┘à╪ج╪│╪│╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪╣┘┘è┘à┘è╪ر ╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘┘ç╪د ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│┘ç╪د ┘à┘ ╪«┘╪د┘ ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘ê╪د╪ص╪».\",\"en\":\"Schoolina is a management system for schools and educational groups, covering the student journey from enrollment and record management to attendance, assignments, examinations, and results. It also brings tuition fees, accounting, human resources, transportation, and school resources into one unified environment.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe platform provides dedicated portals for administrators, teachers, students, and parents, supported by access permissions and reports tailored to their responsibilities. Its multi-school capabilities allow educational organizations to manage and oversee several schools through a single system.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ز┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç ╪د┘┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│ ╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘┘è ╪ز┘╪│┘è┘é ╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘┘ç╪د ╪╣┘╪»┘à╪د ╪ز╪ز┘ê╪▓╪╣ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪▒╪│┘ê┘à ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ╪ذ┘è┘ ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪▒┘é┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ش╪»╪د┘ê┘ ┘ê╪ذ╪▒╪د┘à╪ش ┘à┘┘╪╡┘╪ر. ┘è╪ج╪»┘è ╪░┘┘â ╪ح┘┘ë ╪ز┘â╪▒╪د╪▒ ╪ح╪»╪«╪د┘ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ╪ح┘┘ë ┘à╪╣┘┘ê┘à╪د╪ز ┘à╪ص╪»╪س╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ز╪ث╪«╪▒ ╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪ث┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث┘à┘ê╪▒╪î ┘ê╪▓┘è╪د╪»╪ر ╪د┘┘ê┘é╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪╖┘┘ê╪ذ ┘╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘ê╪ز╪▓╪»╪د╪» ┘ç╪░┘ç ╪د┘╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪د╪ز ┘╪»┘ë ╪د┘┘à╪ج╪│╪│╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز┘è ╪ز╪»┘è╪▒ ╪╣╪»╪ر ┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│ ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪ز╪د╪ش ╪ح┘┘ë ╪▒╪ج┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د╪╢╪ص╪ر ┘┘╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث┘â╪د╪»┘è┘à┘è ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è.\",\"en\":\"Schools face coordination challenges when student records, attendance, fees, and employee information are scattered across paper documents, spreadsheets, and separate applications. This creates duplicate data entry, makes updated information harder to access, delays communication with parents, and increases the effort required to prepare reports.\\r\\n\\r\\nThese challenges become more complex for organizations managing multiple schools that need a clear view of academic, financial, and operational performance.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘è╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪│┘â┘ê┘┘è┘╪د ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪│┘è╪ر ┘┘è ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪ر ╪ز╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘à┘è┘ ┘ê╪ث┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث┘à┘ê╪▒ ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث┘â╪د╪»┘è┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒┘è╪ر. ┘ê╪ز╪│╪د╪╣╪» ┘à╪│╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪╕┘à╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪»╪»╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪د┘┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪î ┘ê╪ز┘è╪│┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪│┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ز┘╪│┘è┘é ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪│╪ر.\",\"en\":\"Schoolina consolidates school operations into one platform, connecting student, teacher, and parent information with academic, financial, and administrative workflows. Structured processes, notifications, reporting, and defined access permissions help reduce manual work, simplify monitoring, and improve coordination across school departments.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Multi-School Management & Access Control\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à╪»╪د╪▒╪│ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر ┘ê╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à┘ç╪د ╪╢┘à┘ ┘à╪ش┘à┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ╪ز╪╣┘┘è┘à┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage multiple schools and organize them into educational groups.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡ ╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘â┘ ┘à╪»╪▒╪│╪ر ┘ê╪│┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘ç╪د ╪د┘╪»╪▒╪د╪│┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Configure school-specific settings and academic years.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ┘ê╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘.\", \"en\": \"Define user roles and access permissions.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪ث┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث┘à┘ê╪▒\", \"en\": \"Student & Parent Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز┘ç┘à ┘ê┘à┘┘╪د╪ز┘ç┘à ╪د┘╪»╪▒╪د╪│┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage student enrollment, profiles, and academic records.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ╪ذ╪ث┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪ث┘à┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪ز┘ê┘┘è╪▒ ╪ذ┘ê╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪ذ┘╪د╪ة.\", \"en\": \"Link students to parents and provide portals for tracking their childrenظآs progress.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د┘ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ╪ح┘┘ë ╪د┘╪╡┘┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ح╪╡╪»╪د╪▒ ╪د┘╪ذ╪╖╪د┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪┤┘ç╪د╪»╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Manage student promotion and issue ID cards and certificates.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث┘â╪د╪»┘è┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘╪ز╪»╪▒┘è╪│\", \"en\": \"Academic Management & Teaching Organization\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╡┘┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪┤╪╣╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪» ┘ê╪د┘┘é╪د╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪»╪▒╪د╪│┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage classes, sections, subjects, and classrooms.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪ش╪»╪د┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪ص╪╡╪╡ ┘ê╪ز┘ê╪▓┘è╪╣ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪» ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘à┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Create timetables and assign teachers and subjects.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪«╪╖╪╖ ╪د┘╪»╪▒┘ê╪│ ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪د╪ش╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à╪┤╪د╪▒┘â╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘╪ز╪╣┘┘è┘à┘è.\", \"en\": \"Manage lesson plans, homework, and shared learning materials.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪ص╪╡╪╡ ╪د┘╪د╪ص╪ز┘è╪د╪╖ ┘ê╪ز╪║╪╖┘è╪ر ╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘à┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Coordinate substitute teaching and teacher absence coverage.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪│┘┘ê┘â ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ┘è\", \"en\": \"Attendance & Student Behavior\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪║┘è╪د╪ذ┘ç┘à ┘ê╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Record student attendance and absences and generate follow-up reports.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪▒╪│╪د┘ ╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ.\", \"en\": \"Send student absence notifications.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê╪س┘è┘é ╪د┘┘ê┘é╪د╪خ╪╣ ╪د┘╪│┘┘ê┘â┘è╪ر ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘┘é╪د╪╖ ╪د┘╪│┘┘ê┘â ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Document behavioral incidents and track behavior points and reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪د╪«╪ز╪ذ╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é┘è┘è┘à\", \"en\": \"Examinations & Assessment\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪د┘╪د╪«╪ز╪ذ╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ش╪»╪د┘ê┘┘ç╪د ┘ê╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪»╪▒╪ش╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘╪ز╪د╪خ╪ش.\", \"en\": \"Configure examinations, organize schedules, and record marks and results.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪«╪╖╪╖ ╪د┘╪ش┘┘ê╪│ ┘ê╪ح╪╡╪»╪د╪▒ ╪ذ╪╖╪د┘é╪د╪ز ╪»╪«┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪د╪«╪ز╪ذ╪د╪▒╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Prepare seating plans and issue examination admission cards.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ┘ê╪ز┘é╪»┘è╪▒╪د╪ز┘ç┘à.\", \"en\": \"Generate student achievement and grade reports.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ث╪│╪ذ╪د╪ذ ╪د┘╪╢╪╣┘ ╪د┘╪»╪▒╪د╪│┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪ذ╪▒╪د┘à╪ش ╪د┘╪╣┘╪د╪ش┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage academic difficulty reasons and remedial programs.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪▒╪│┘ê┘à ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Fees & Accounting\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪د┘╪▒╪│┘ê┘à ╪د┘╪»╪▒╪د╪│┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪╡┘ê┘à╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ح╪╡╪»╪د╪▒ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒.\", \"en\": \"Configure tuition fees and discounts and issue invoices.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ذ╪د┘╪║ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ص┘é╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Track payments and outstanding balances.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪▒╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ذ┘┘â┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘é┘è┘ê╪» ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪د╪│╪ذ┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage income, expenses, bank accounts, and journal entries.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ┘à┘è╪▓╪د┘ ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘è╪▓╪د┘┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Generate trial balances, balance sheets, and financial reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر\", \"en\": \"Human Resources\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘à┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│┘à┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘ê╪╕┘è┘┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage staff and teacher profiles, departments, and job titles.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪ش╪د╪▓╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Track employee attendance and leave.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Prepare payroll and related reports.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ز┘é┘è┘è┘à╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘à┘è┘ ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘╪ز╪د╪خ╪ش┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Manage teacher evaluations and review their results.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘┘é┘ ╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪│┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪د┘╪╡╪▒╪د┘\", \"en\": \"School Transportation & Dismissal\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒┘â╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪«╪╖┘ê╪╖ ╪د┘┘┘é┘ ┘ê╪ز┘ê╪▓┘è╪╣ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪د╪ذ ╪╣┘┘è┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Manage vehicles, transportation routes, and student assignments.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪╖╪▒┘è┘é╪ر ╪د┘╪╡╪▒╪د┘ ╪د┘╪╖╪د┘╪ذ ┘ê╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪│┘è┘╪ر ╪د┘┘┘é┘.\", \"en\": \"Record student dismissal arrangements and transportation details.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪»┘è┘à ┘ê┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪ز╪║┘è┘è╪▒ ╪╖╪▒┘è┘é╪ر ╪د┘╪د┘╪╡╪▒╪د┘.\", \"en\": \"Submit and review requests to change dismissal arrangements.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘┘é┘ ╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪│┘è.\", \"en\": \"Generate school transportation reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à┘â╪ز╪ذ╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘\", \"en\": \"Library, Inventory & Assets\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘â╪ز╪ذ ┘ê╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘╪د╪ز┘ç╪د ┘ê╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح╪╣╪د╪▒╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage books, categories, and borrowing records.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘╪د┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪د╪▓┘ ┘ê╪ص╪▒┘â╪ر ╪د┘╪╡╪▒┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز┘╪د┘à.\", \"en\": \"Track inventory items, storage locations, receipts, and issues.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪س╪د╪ذ╪ز╪ر ┘ê╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Register and categorize fixed assets.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ص╪▒┘â╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘╪د┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘┘ç╪».\", \"en\": \"Generate inventory movement and asset custody reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒\", \"en\": \"Communication & Reporting\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘╪┤╪▒ ╪د┘╪ح╪╣┘╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘╪╣╪د┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪»╪▒╪│┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Publish school announcements, notifications, and events.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê┘┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪د╪»╪س╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘╪▒╪»┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ش┘à╪د╪╣┘è╪ر ╪»╪د╪«┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Support individual and group conversations within the platform.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪┤╪د╪▒┘â╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪» ╪د┘╪ز╪╣┘┘è┘à┘è╪ر ┘à╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘è┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Share files and learning materials with relevant users.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ┘┘ê╪ص╪د╪ز ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ث┘â╪د╪»┘è┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Provide dashboards and academic, financial, and administrative reports.\"}]}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,15,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-05 06:43:53','2026-09-05 06:43:53',NULL),(23,'{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╣┘à┘è╪▒ ظ¤ ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘┘é ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر\",\"en\":\"Tameer ظ¤ Facilities & Maintenance\"}','tameer-facilities-maintenance',NULL,NULL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘┘é ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘ ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر╪î ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣╪î ┘ê╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘┘ê┘é╪د╪خ┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ┘╪▒┘é ╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ┘┘è ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è ┘ê╪د╪ص╪».\",\"en\":\"An integrated platform for managing facilities, assets, and maintenance operations, bringing multiple sites, work orders, preventive maintenance, and team performance into one centralized system.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╣┘à┘è╪▒ ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪▒┘é┘à┘è╪ر ╪ز╪│╪د╪╣╪» ╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê┘╪▒┘é ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘┘é ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ ┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر. ╪ز╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ذ╪د┘┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê┘╪▒┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪î ┘ê╪ز╪ز┘è╪ص ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ┘à┘ ╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ذ┘╪د╪║ ┘ê╪ز╪╣┘è┘è┘ ╪د┘┘┘┘è ┘ê╪ص╪ز┘ë ╪د┘╪ز┘┘┘è╪░ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪║┘╪د┘é.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘ê╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪ش╪»┘ê┘╪ر ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘┘ê┘é╪د╪خ┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╣╪╖╪د┘╪î ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د╪ز┘╪د┘é┘è╪د╪ز ┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ز┘ê╪س┘è┘é ╪د┘╪ص┘ê╪د╪»╪س ┘ê┘à╪ز╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪ز╪╡╪د╪▒┘è╪ص ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘. ┘â┘à╪د ╪ز┘ê┘╪▒ ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘ê┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ╪ز┘à┘╪ص ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪▒╪ج┘è╪ر ╪ث┘ê╪╢╪ص ┘╪ص╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘╪î ┘ê╪ز┘é╪»┘à ╪د┘╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘╪î ┘ê╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ╪د┘┘╪▒┘é.\",\"en\":\"Tameer is a digital platform that helps companies and facilities management teams coordinate operations and maintenance across multiple sites. It connects locations, buildings, assets, and teams, allowing maintenance requests to be tracked from initial reporting and technician assignment through execution, review, and closure.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe platform combines preventive maintenance scheduling, corrective work orders, service level tracking, incident documentation, and work permit requirements. Reports and performance indicators give management clearer visibility into asset condition, work progress, and team performance.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ز┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘┘é ╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘┘è ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘ ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪╣┘╪» ╪ز┘ê╪▓┘è╪╣ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪ذ┘è┘ ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘à┘┘╪╡┘╪ر ┘ê┘é┘┘ê╪د╪ز ╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر. ┘ê┘è╪▓╪»╪د╪» ╪د┘╪ز╪ص╪»┘è ┘à╪╣ ╪ز╪╣╪»╪» ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ┘ê┘╪▒┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪î ┘à┘à╪د ┘è╪╡╪╣┘ّ╪ذ ╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ج┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪ث╪«╪▒╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪د┘╪ز╪▓╪د┘à ╪ذ┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪»┘ê╪▒┘è╪ر.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘â╪░┘┘â╪î ┘╪ح┘ ╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪│╪ش┘ ┘à┘ê╪ص╪» ┘┘╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘ ┘ê┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د╪╢╪ص╪ر ┘┘╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ┘è╪ص╪»┘ّ ┘à┘ ┘é╪»╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘é┘è┘è┘à ╪ش┘ê╪»╪ر ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر ┘ê╪د╪ز╪«╪د╪░ ┘é╪▒╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘à╪ذ┘┘è╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز.\",\"en\":\"Managing facilities becomes difficult when asset records and maintenance activities are spread across separate files and communication channels. As the number of sites and teams grows, assigning responsibility, tracking overdue requests, and keeping up with scheduled maintenance become increasingly challenging.\\r\\n\\r\\nWithout a unified maintenance history and clear performance indicators, management has limited visibility into service quality and fewer reliable insights to support operational decisions.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ز┘ê╪ص┘ّ╪» ╪ز╪╣┘à┘è╪▒ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘┘é ┘ê╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪»╪د╪«┘ ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪ر╪î ╪ز╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘â┘ ╪╖┘╪ذ ╪ذ╪د┘┘à┘ê┘é╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘╪▒┘è┘é ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ج┘ê┘. ┘ê╪ز┘ê┘╪▒ ┘à╪│╪د╪▒┘ï╪د ┘ê╪د╪╢╪ص┘ï╪د ┘╪ز┘┘┘è╪░ ╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪î ┘à╪╣ ╪ز┘ê┘┘è╪» ╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘┘ê┘é╪د╪خ┘è╪ر ╪ز┘┘é╪د╪خ┘è┘ï╪د ┘ê┘┘é ╪د┘╪ش╪»╪د┘ê┘ ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪»╪»╪ر╪î ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ث┘ê┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز╪ش╪د╪ذ╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش╪د╪▓.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘ê┘à┘ ╪«┘╪د┘ ╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒╪î ╪ز╪│╪د╪╣╪» ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è╪î ┘ê╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪│┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ز┘╪│┘è┘é ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘┘┘è┘è┘.\",\"en\":\"Tameer centralizes facilities data and maintenance workflows, connecting each request to its location, asset, and responsible team. It provides a structured work order lifecycle, automatically generates preventive maintenance work orders according to configured schedules, and tracks response and resolution targets.\\r\\n\\r\\nThrough maintenance records, notifications, and reporting, the platform helps organize daily operations, reduce manual follow-ups, and improve coordination between managers, supervisors, and technicians.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د┘┘é\", \"en\": \"Facilities & Site Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ╪د┘╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘┘ç╪د ┘à┘ ┘à┘â╪د┘ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪».\", \"en\": \"Manage companies and their associated sites in one place.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ╪ح┘┘ë ┘à┘╪د╪╖┘é ┘ê┘à╪ذ╪د┘┘ ┘ê╪╖┘ê╪د╪ذ┘é ┘ê┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Organize locations into zones, buildings, floors, and units.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╣┘è┘è┘ ┘à╪»┘è╪▒┘è ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ╪ذ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒╪ص ┘┘ç┘à ╪ذ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ╪ح┘┘è┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Assign site managers and control user access to authorized sites.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣╪»╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Asset & Equipment Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘╪د╪ز┘ç╪د ┘ê┘à┘ê╪د╪╡┘╪د╪ز┘ç╪د ┘ê┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Maintain asset details, categories, specifications, and locations.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ص┘╪╕ ╪ز┘ê╪د╪▒┘è╪« ╪د┘╪ز╪▒┘â┘è╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘╪╢┘à╪د┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪│╪د╪ذ┘é╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘é╪د╪»┘à╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Record installation dates, warranty expiry, and past and upcoming maintenance dates.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ╪▒┘à┘ê╪▓ QR ┘ê┘à╪│╪ص┘ç╪د ┘┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ╪ح┘┘ë ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ ┘ê╪│╪ش┘ ╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ز┘ç.\", \"en\": \"Generate and scan QR codes to access asset information and maintenance history.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪▒┘╪د┘é ╪د┘╪╡┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ╪ذ╪«╪╖╪╖ ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘.\", \"en\": \"Attach images and files, and link assets to maintenance plans and work orders.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ذ┘╪د╪║╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘\", \"en\": \"Maintenance Requests & Work Orders\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪د┘┘à┘ê┘é╪╣ ┘ê┘┘ê╪╣ ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘ê┘┘ê┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Create maintenance requests with location, service type, and priority.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪│┘╪د╪» ╪د┘╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘ ╪ح┘┘ë ╪د┘┘┘┘è┘è┘ ┘ê╪ح╪╣╪د╪»╪ر ╪ح╪│┘╪د╪»┘ç╪د ╪╣┘╪» ╪د┘╪ص╪د╪ش╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Assign and reassign work to technicians.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘à╪▒╪د╪ص┘ ╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ ┘à┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪ص╪ز┘ë ╪د┘╪ز┘┘┘è╪░ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪║┘╪د┘é.\", \"en\": \"Track requests from submission through execution, review, and closure.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê╪س┘è┘é ╪ز╪║┘è┘è╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ص╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒┘┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘é╪╖╪╣ ╪د┘╪║┘è╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘é╪╖╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Record status changes, attachments, spare parts requests, and parts used.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘┘ê┘é╪د╪خ┘è╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪ش╪»┘ê┘╪ر\", \"en\": \"Planned Preventive Maintenance\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ╪«╪╖╪╖ ╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ╪»┘ê╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖┘ç╪د ╪ذ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘.\", \"en\": \"Create recurring maintenance plans and link them to assets.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê┘┘è╪» ╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪ز┘┘é╪د╪خ┘è┘ï╪د ╪╣┘╪» ╪د╪│╪ز╪ص┘é╪د┘é ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Automatically generate work orders when maintenance becomes due.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ┘é┘ê╪د╪خ┘à ┘╪ص╪╡ ┘ê┘à┘ç╪د┘à ╪ز┘╪╡┘è┘┘è╪ر ┘┘â┘ ╪«╪╖╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Define checklists and detailed maintenance tasks.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ح┘╪ش╪د╪▓ ╪د┘┘à┘ç╪د┘à ┘ê╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ┘à┘╪د╪ص╪╕╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز┘┘┘è╪░.\", \"en\": \"Track task completion and record execution notes.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د╪ز┘╪د┘é┘è╪د╪ز ┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر ظ¤ SLA\", \"en\": \"Service Level Agreement Tracking\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪ث┘ê┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز╪ش╪د╪ذ╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش╪د╪▓ ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘┘à┘ê┘é╪╣ ┘ê┘┘ê╪╣ ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘ê┘┘ê┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Configure response and resolution targets by site, service type, and priority.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡ ╪د┘┘à╪»╪» ╪»╪د╪«┘ ╪│╪د╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ┘ê╪«╪د╪▒╪ش┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Set different targets for working hours and after-hours periods.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪ص╪ز╪│╪د╪ذ ┘╪ز╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ز╪╣┘┘è┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ┘ê╪ز╪╣╪»┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘ç╪»┘╪ر ╪╣┘╪» ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز╪خ┘╪د┘.\", \"en\": \"Account for on-hold periods and adjust deadlines when work resumes.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪ث╪«╪▒╪ر ┘ê┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د┘╪ز╪▓╪د┘à ╪ذ┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Monitor overdue requests and SLA compliance indicators.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘╪▒┘é ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Team & Access Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Manage users, departments, roles, and permissions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê╪▓┘è╪╣ ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ╪ح┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ┘ê┘┘é ┘à╪│╪ج┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Assign site access according to user responsibilities.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê┘┘è╪▒ ╪╣╪▒┘ê╪╢ ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر ┘┘┘à╪»┘è╪▒┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Provide dedicated management and supervisor views.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ç╪د┘à ╪د┘┘à╪│┘╪»╪ر ┘┘┘┘┘è┘è┘ ┘ê┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ث╪»╪د╪خ┘ç┘à.\", \"en\": \"Track technicians assigned tasks and performance indicators.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ص┘ê╪د╪»╪س ┘ê┘à╪ز╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪ز╪╡╪د╪▒┘è╪ص ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘\", \"en\": \"Incidents & Work Permit Requirements\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ص┘ê╪د╪»╪س ┘ê╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘┘ç╪د ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪╖┘ê╪▒╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪د┘╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Record incidents by type, severity, and status.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘ê╪س┘è┘é ╪د┘┘à┘ê┘é╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪┤╪«╪د╪╡ ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪ث╪س╪▒┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪┤┘ç┘ê╪» ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪ش╪▒╪د╪ة╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘┘ê╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒┘┘é╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Document locations, affected people, witnesses, immediate actions, and attachments.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘é┘ê╪د╪خ┘à ┘à╪ز╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪ز╪╡╪د╪▒┘è╪ص ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ┘ê┘à┘ç╪د┘à┘ç╪د ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖┘ç╪د ╪ذ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘.\", \"en\": \"Manage work permit requirement checklists and tasks, and link them to assets.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘ê┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪»╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Reports & Performance Insights\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ┘à┘╪«╪╡╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ص╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر ┘ê┘à╪╣╪»┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش╪د╪▓.\", \"en\": \"View work order summaries, maintenance statuses, and completion rates.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ث┘ê┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪╣╪د┘╪ش╪ر ┘ê┘╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪د┘╪ز╪▓╪د┘à ╪ذ┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Track resolution times and SLA compliance.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘┘à┘ê┘é╪╣ ┘ê┘┘ê╪╣ ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘┘┘è.\", \"en\": \"Analyze performance by site, service type, and technician.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╡╪»┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د╪│╪ز┘è╪▒╪د╪» ╪د┘╪│╪ش┘╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪د╪│╪ز╪«╪»╪د┘à ┘é┘ê╪د┘╪ذ ╪ش╪د┘ç╪▓╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Export data and import records using predefined templates.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪│╪ش┘ ╪د┘╪ث┘╪┤╪╖╪ر\", \"en\": \"Notifications & Activity History\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪║┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à┘é╪▒┘ê╪ة ┘à┘┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"View notifications and track unread updates.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪▒╪│╪د┘ ┘à┘╪«╪╡╪د╪ز ┘è┘ê┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ث╪│╪ذ┘ê╪╣┘è╪ر ┘ê┘┘é ╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à.\", \"en\": \"Send daily summaries and weekly reports according to system settings.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪د╪ص╪ز┘╪د╪╕ ╪ذ╪│╪ش┘ ┘┘╪ث┘╪┤╪╖╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪║┘è┘è╪▒╪د╪ز ┘╪»╪╣┘à ╪د┘┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Maintain activity and change logs for operational tracking and review.\"}]}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-06 05:32:06','2026-09-06 05:32:11',NULL),(24,'{\"ar\":\"Future ERP\",\"en\":\"Future ERP\"}','future-erp',NULL,NULL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"Future ERP ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘┘à╪ج╪│╪│╪د╪ز╪î ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪د╪│╪ذ╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘┘è ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪î ┘┘à╪│╪د╪╣╪»╪ر ╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘┘ç╪د ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ث╪»╪د╪خ┘ç╪د ╪ذ┘â┘╪د╪ة╪ر.\",\"en\":\"Future ERP is an integrated enterprise resource planning platform that brings accounting, sales, inventory, HR, customer relationships, and project management into one system, helping businesses organize operations and monitor performance efficiently.\"}','{\"ar\":\"Future ERP ┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘ ┘è┘ê╪ص┘ّ╪» ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è╪ر ╪»╪د╪«┘ ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è╪ر. ┘è╪ز┘è╪ص ┘┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪»┘ê╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪ذ╪»╪د┘è╪ر┘ï ┘à┘ ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪╣╪▒┘ê╪╢ ╪د┘╪ث╪│╪╣╪د╪▒╪î ┘à╪▒┘ê╪▒┘ï╪د ╪ذ╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪د╪▓┘╪î ┘ê╪╡┘ê┘┘ï╪د ╪ح┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪د╪│╪ذ╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘è╪╣╪ز┘à╪» ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪╣┘┘ë ┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ┘é╪د╪ذ┘╪ر ┘┘╪ز┘╪╣┘è┘ ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د╪ص╪ز┘è╪د╪ش╪د╪ز ┘â┘ ╪┤╪▒┘â╪ر╪î ┘à╪╣ ╪»╪╣┘à ┘à╪│╪د╪ص╪د╪ز ╪╣┘à┘ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر ┘ê╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ┘┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ┘ê┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪د╪ز ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر ╪د┘┘╪║╪د╪ز╪î ╪ذ┘à╪د ┘┘è┘ç╪د ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è╪ر. ┘â┘à╪د ┘è╪╢┘à ┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ┘à╪ز╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر ┘┘é╪╖╪د╪╣╪د╪ز ┘à╪«╪ز┘┘╪ر╪î ┘╪ز┘ê╪│┘è╪╣ ┘╪╖╪د┘é ╪د┘╪د╪│╪ز╪«╪»╪د┘à ┘à╪╣ ┘┘à┘ê ╪د┘╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘.\",\"en\":\"Future ERP centralizes financial, administrative, and operational processes in a single business management platform. It supports the business cycle from lead tracking and quotations to sales, purchasing, inventory, accounting, payroll, and reporting.\\r\\n\\r\\nIts modular architecture allows companies to activate capabilities according to their needs. With multiple workspaces, user permissions, and multilingual interfacesظ¤including Arabic and Englishظ¤the platform supports different organizational structures. Industry-specific modules extend its functionality as business requirements evolve.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ز┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç ╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘┘è ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘┘ç╪د ╪╣┘╪»┘à╪د ╪ز╪ز┘ê╪▓╪╣ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪ذ┘è┘ ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز Excel ┘ê╪ذ╪▒╪د┘à╪ش ┘à┘┘╪╡┘╪ر ┘┘â┘ ┘é╪│┘à. ┘è╪ج╪»┘è ╪░┘┘â ╪ح┘┘ë ╪ز┘â╪▒╪د╪▒ ╪ح╪»╪«╪د┘ ╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘ê┘à╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘à╪╖╪د╪ذ┘é╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪ز╪ث╪«╪▒ ╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒╪î ┘ê╪╢╪╣┘ ╪د┘╪ز┘╪│┘è┘é ╪ذ┘è┘ ┘╪▒┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘ê┘à╪╣ ╪▓┘è╪د╪»╪ر ╪ص╪ش┘à ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز╪î ╪ز╪╡╪ذ╪ص ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ص┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ╪ث┘â╪س╪▒ ╪ز╪╣┘é┘è╪»┘ï╪د╪î ┘ê╪ز┘╪ز┘é╪▒ ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ح┘┘ë ╪▒╪ج┘è╪ر ┘à┘ê╪ص┘ّ╪»╪ر ╪ز╪│╪د╪╣╪»┘ç╪د ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د╪ز╪«╪د╪░ ╪د┘┘é╪▒╪د╪▒╪د╪ز.\",\"en\":\"Businesses often manage their operations through spreadsheets and separate applications for each department. This creates duplicate data entry, makes sales, inventory, and accounting records difficult to reconcile, delays reporting, and limits coordination between teams.\\r\\n\\r\\nAs operations grow, tracking outstanding payments, expenses, employees, and projects becomes increasingly complex. Management lacks a consolidated view of the business to support informed decisions.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘è┘ê┘┘ّ╪▒ Future ERP ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à┘ê╪ص┘ّ╪»╪ر ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ┘ê╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز┘ç╪د╪î ┘ê╪ز╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ╪ذ╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر╪î ┘à╪╣ ╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪ز ┘╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪┤╪ج┘ê┘ ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز.\\r\\n\\r\\n┘ê┘à┘ ╪«┘╪د┘ ╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ث╪ز┘à╪ز╪ر ╪ح╪ش╪▒╪د╪ة╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪î ┘è╪│╪د╪╣╪» ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪د┘┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪î ┘ê╪ز╪│┘ç┘è┘ ╪د┘┘ê╪╡┘ê┘ ╪ح┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à╪╣┘┘ê┘à╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪ز╪ص╪│┘è┘ ╪د┘╪▒┘é╪د╪ذ╪ر ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز. ┘ê╪ز╪ز┘è╪ص ╪ذ┘┘è╪ز┘ç ╪د┘┘à╪▒┘╪ر ╪ز┘╪╣┘è┘ ╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘╪د╪│╪ذ╪ر ┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘╪┤╪د╪╖ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪ز┘è╪د╪ش╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪ر.\",\"en\":\"Future ERP brings departmental data and processes into a unified platform, connecting sales, purchasing, and inventory management with financial operations while providing tools for managing employees, customers, and projects.\\r\\n\\r\\nReporting, access controls, and workflow automation help reduce manual work, improve access to information, and strengthen operational oversight. Its flexible module structure allows businesses to activate the capabilities relevant to their industry and requirements.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ص╪د╪│╪ذ╪ر\", \"en\": \"Financial Management & Accounting\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪»┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘é┘è┘ê╪» ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘╪ز╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage the chart of accounts, journal entries, and financial periods.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪▒╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ذ┘┘â┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Track income, expenses, and bank accounts.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à╪▒╪د┘â╪▓ ╪د┘╪ز┘â┘┘╪ر ┘ê╪ز┘ê╪▓┘è╪╣┘ç╪د ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à╪╣╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪»╪╣┘ê┘à╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage cost centers and allocate them to supported transactions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ث╪▒╪ذ╪د╪ص ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪│╪د╪خ╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪»┘┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘┘é╪»┘è╪ر ┘ê┘â╪┤┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Access profit and loss reports, cash flow reports, and account statements.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘┘ê╪ز╪▒╪ر\", \"en\": \"Sales, Purchasing & Invoicing\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪╣╪▒┘ê╪╢ ╪د┘╪ث╪│╪╣╪د╪▒ ┘ê┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Create quotations and sales invoices.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ث┘ê╪د┘à╪▒ ╪د┘╪┤╪▒╪د╪ة ┘ê┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Manage purchase orders and purchase invoices.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪»┘┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ص┘é╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Record payments and track outstanding balances.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à╪▒╪ز╪ش╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ز╪│┘ê┘è╪د╪ز┘ç╪د.\", \"en\": \"Process sales returns, purchase returns, and related settlements.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡ ┘é┘ê╪د┘╪ذ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪ز╪╡╪»┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪╡┘è╪║ PDF ┘êExcel.\", \"en\": \"Customize invoice templates and export supported documents to PDF and Excel.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘ê╪»╪╣╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Inventory & Warehouse Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘ê╪»╪╣╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Manage products, services, and warehouses.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪ث╪▒╪╡╪»╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪ص╪▒┘â╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘╪د┘.\", \"en\": \"Track stock balances and item movements.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص┘ê┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘ê╪»╪╣╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Transfer inventory between warehouses.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪│┘╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح╪╢╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪╡╪▒┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪│┘ê┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage stock receipt, issue, and adjustment vouchers.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ث╪▒╪╡╪»╪ر ╪د┘╪د┘╪ز╪ز╪د╪ص┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘ê┘è┘╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Access opening balance, purchasing, sales, and transfer reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘┘é╪د╪╖ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣ POS\", \"en\": \"Point of Sale\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣ ┘à┘ ┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪ر ┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر ┘┘┘é╪د╪╖ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣.\", \"en\": \"Record sales through a dedicated POS interface.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╡╪»╪د╪▒ ┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘┘é╪د╪╖ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣ ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Issue POS invoices and track transactions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘è┘ê┘à┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪┤┘ç╪▒┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Access daily and monthly sales reports.\"}, {\"ar\": \"- ╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘â╪د╪┤┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘è╪▒╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘é╪د╪▒┘╪ر ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪┤╪ز╪▒┘è╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Review cashier performance, income, and sales-versus-purchases reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘┘╪▒╪╡ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣┘è╪ر CRM\", \"en\": \"Customer Relationship Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪ز┘à┘┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Manage customer and lead records.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╡┘┘é╪د╪ز ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ ┘à╪▒╪د╪ص┘ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣ ╪د┘┘à╪«╪ز┘┘╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Track deals through different sales stages.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡ ┘à╪│╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪╣ ┘ê┘à╪▒╪د╪ص┘ ╪د┘┘╪▒╪╡.\", \"en\": \"Configure sales pipelines and opportunity stages.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪ز┘à┘┘è┘ ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘┘à╪╡╪»╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘ê╪│┘ê┘à.\", \"en\": \"Organize leads by source and labels.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ\", \"en\": \"Human Resources & Payroll\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪╕┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘╪▒┘ê╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘é╪│╪د┘à ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│┘à┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘ê╪╕┘è┘┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage employee profiles, branches, departments, and job titles.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪د┘╪╡╪▒╪د┘ ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à┘ê╪د┘é╪╣ ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒.\", \"en\": \"Record attendance and manage attendance locations.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ح╪ش╪د╪▓╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ث╪░┘ê┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪«╪▒┘ê╪ش ┘ê╪د┘╪╣╪╖┘╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Handle leave requests, exit permissions, and holidays.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ ┘ê╪د┘╪ذ╪»┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪╡┘ê┘à╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘é╪▒┘ê╪╢ ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ╪د┘╪ح╪╢╪د┘┘è.\", \"en\": \"Configure salaries, allowances, deductions, loans, and overtime.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╡╪»╪د╪▒ ┘â╪┤┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪▒┘ê╪د╪ز╪ذ ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪ش╪د╪▓╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Generate payslips, attendance reports, and leave reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê┘╪▒┘é ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘\", \"en\": \"Project & Team Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘┘à┘ç╪د┘à ┘ê┘à╪▒╪د╪ص┘ ╪د┘╪ز┘┘┘è╪░.\", \"en\": \"Create projects and organize tasks and execution stages.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ش╪»╪د┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪▓┘à┘┘è╪ر ╪ذ╪د╪│╪ز╪«╪»╪د┘à ┘à╪«╪╖╪╖╪د╪ز Gantt.\", \"en\": \"Monitor project schedules using Gantt charts.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘┘ê┘é╪ز ┘ê╪│╪د╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ ┘à┘ ╪«┘╪د┘ ╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Track time and working hours through dedicated modules.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘à╪┤┘â┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╣╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ز┘é╪»┘à ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘.\", \"en\": \"Monitor project issues and progress reports.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪»╪╣┘à ╪د┘┘é╪▒╪د╪▒\", \"en\": \"Reporting & Business Insights\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘┘ê╪ص╪د╪ز ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ┘╪╣╪▒╪╢ ┘à╪ج╪┤╪▒╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘.\", \"en\": \"View business indicators through dashboards.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ذ┘è╪╣┘è╪ر ┘ê┘à╪«╪▓┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ┘┘┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪د┘╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Access financial, sales, inventory, and HR reports.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص┘┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ح┘è╪▒╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╡╪▒┘ê┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ ┘╪ز╪▒╪د╪ز ┘à╪«╪ز┘┘╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Analyze income, expenses, and performance across reporting periods.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╡╪»┘è╪▒ ╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪»╪╣┘ê┘à╪ر ╪ح┘┘ë Excel ┘êPDF.\", \"en\": \"Export supported reports to Excel and PDF.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘╪╕╪د┘à ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡\", \"en\": \"Administration & Customization\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘ ┘ê┘à╪│╪د╪ص╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘.\", \"en\": \"Manage companies, users, and workspaces.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ص╪»┘è╪» ╪د┘╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪ص╪│╪ذ ┘à╪│╪ج┘ê┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘è┘.\", \"en\": \"Configure roles and permissions based on user responsibilities.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪»╪╣┘à ╪د┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪▒╪ش┘à╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Support Arabic, English, and translation management.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪«╪╡┘è╪╡ ╪د┘╪ص┘é┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘┘┘à╪د╪░╪ش ┘ê┘é┘ê╪د┘╪ذ ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘╪»╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Customize fields, forms, and document templates.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ذ╪د┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪د╪┤╪ز╪▒╪د┘â╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ز┘╪╣┘è┘ ╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪«╪╖╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manage plans, subscriptions, and module availability.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ث╪ز┘à╪ز╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Automation & Integrations\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪» ╪ح╪ش╪▒╪د╪ة╪د╪ز ╪╣┘à┘ ╪ز╪╣╪ز┘à╪» ╪╣┘┘ë ╪ث╪ص╪»╪د╪س ┘ê╪┤╪▒┘ê╪╖ ┘à╪ص╪»╪»╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Configure workflows based on defined events and conditions.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز ┘┘╪»┘╪╣ ╪د┘╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è ┘ê╪د┘╪▒╪│╪د╪خ┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Integrate electronic payments, messaging, and notifications.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘ê╪╕╪د╪خ┘ ┘┘╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ┘à╪╣ ZATCA ┘ê╪ح╪▒╪│╪د┘ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪ز╪ش╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪»╪╣┘ê┘à╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Use ZATCA integration functions to submit supported invoices and returns.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪ز ┘à╪│╪د╪╣╪»╪ر ┘╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ╪د┘┘à╪ص╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪ذ╪د┘╪░┘â╪د╪ة ╪د┘╪د╪╡╪╖┘╪د╪╣┘è.\", \"en\": \"Access AI-assisted content generation tools.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ┘à╪ز╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘┘╪┤╪د╪╖\", \"en\": \"Industry-Specific Modules\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪╡┘┘è╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪╡┘ê┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘è╪د┘╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Manufacturing, asset, and maintenance management.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪│╪د╪╖┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪┤╪ص┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪«╪»┘à╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘┘ê╪ش╪│╪ز┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Fleet, freight, and logistics management.\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘é╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪ث╪ش┘è╪▒.\", \"en\": \"Property and rental management.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ┘┘┘à╪│╪ز╪┤┘┘è╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪╣╪د┘à┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘è╪»┘┘è╪د╪ز.\", \"en\": \"Hospital, laboratory, and pharmacy modules.\"}, {\"ar\": \"┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ┘┘┘┘╪د╪»┘é ┘ê╪د┘╪│┘╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ث┘╪┤╪╖╪ر ╪د┘╪«╪»┘à┘è╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Hotel, travel, and service business modules.\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪ز┘ê┘╪▒ ╪د┘┘ê╪ص╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ح╪╢╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪ذ╪د┘é╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘╪╣┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪»╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪«╪د╪╡╪ر ╪ذ┘â┘ ╪┤╪▒┘â╪ر.\", \"en\": \"Additional modules and integrations depend on each companyظآs subscription, activation, and configuration.\"}, \"points\": []}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'published',0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-06 08:36:34','2026-09-06 09:53:39',NULL),(25,'{\"ar\":\"╪د╪│╪ز╪┤╪د╪▒┘è\",\"en\":\"Asteshary\"}','asteshary',NULL,NULL,NULL,'web','{\"ar\":\"┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘è╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ┘ê╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪╣┘╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘à╪╣ APIs ┘╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪ذ╪د┘è┘.\",\"en\":\"A healthcare admin dashboard for managing clinics, doctors, patients, appointments, billing, ads, and platform operations with APIs for mobile apps.\"}','{\"ar\":\"Asteshary Admin Dashboard ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è╪ر ┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر ╪ص╪ش╪▓ ╪╖╪ذ┘è. ╪ذ╪ز┘à┘â┘ّ┘ ┘╪▒┘è┘é ╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ┘à┘ ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪┤╪ت╪ز ╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ر (╪╣┘è╪د╪»╪د╪ز\\/┘à╪│╪ز╪┤┘┘è╪د╪ز)╪î ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة╪î ╪د┘┘à╪▒╪╢┘ë╪î ╪د┘╪ص╪ش┘ê╪▓╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪ز┘é┘è┘è┘à╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪ص╪│╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر╪î ╪د┘╪ح╪╣┘╪د┘╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘┘â┘ê╪▒╪│╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘┘ê╪╕╪د╪خ┘╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪»╪╣┘à ╪د┘┘┘┘è ┘à┘ ┘à┘â╪د┘ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪».\\r\\n ┘ê╪ز┘ê┘╪▒ APIs ┘┘╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز╪î ╪ح╪┤╪╣╪د╪▒╪د╪ز Push╪î ╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒╪î ┘ê╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘┘è╪ر.\",\"en\":\"Asteshary Admin Dashboard is a centralized control panel for a medical booking platform. It helps the operations team manage medical enterprises (clinics\\/hospitals), doctors, patients, reservations, reviews, finances, marketing ads, courses, jobs, and support tickets from one place.\\r\\nit also exposes APIs for mobile apps, push notifications, role-based access, and reporting.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘à┘╪╡╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪▒╪╣╪د┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪╡╪ص┘è╪ر ╪║╪د┘╪ذ┘ï╪د ╪ذ╪ز╪┤╪ز╪║┘ ╪ذ╪┤┘â┘ ┘à╪ز┘╪▒┘é: ╪د┘╪╣┘è╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪» ┘â┘ ┘ê╪د╪ص╪» ┘┘ê╪ص╪»┘ç╪î ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪║╪د╪ة ╪╡╪╣╪ذ╪ر╪î ╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╢┘à╪د┘à ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘╪ز┘é┘è┘è┘à╪د╪ز ┘à╪ص╪ز╪د╪ش╪ر ┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر╪î ╪د┘┘┘ê╪ز╪▒╪ر ┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪ر╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪ح╪╣┘╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪»┘ê┘ ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘à╪▒┘â╪▓┘è. ╪د┘┘╪ز┘è╪ش╪ر: ╪╢┘è╪د╪╣ ┘ê┘é╪ز ┘ê╪╢╪╣┘ ┘┘è ╪د┘╪▒╪ج┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘â┘à.\",\"en\":\"Healthcare platforms often struggle with fragmented operations: clinics, doctors, and appointments are managed separately; booking confirmation and attendance are hard to track; reviews and doctor applications need moderation; invoicing is manual; and marketing\\/ads lack centralized control. Without one admin system, teams waste time and lose visibility.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪╣┘à┘┘╪د ┘┘ê╪ص╪ر ╪ث╪»┘à┘ ┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر ╪ذ╪ز╪ش┘à╪╣ ╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪ر: ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪┤╪ت╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘╪▒┘ê╪╣╪î ┘é╪ذ┘ê┘\\/╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة╪î ╪ش╪»┘ê┘╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪د╪╣┘è╪»╪î ╪ز╪ث┘â┘è╪» ╪د┘╪ص╪╢┘ê╪▒╪î ┘à╪▒╪د╪ش╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ز┘é┘è┘è┘à╪د╪ز╪î ╪ح╪╡╪»╪د╪▒ ╪د┘┘┘ê╪د╪ز┘è╪▒╪î ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ح╪╣┘╪د┘╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪»╪╣┘à ┘à╪╣ APIs ╪ز╪▒╪ذ╪╖ ╪ز╪ش╪▒╪ذ╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪▒┘è╪╢ ┘ê╪د┘╪╖╪ذ┘è╪ذ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪ذ╪د┘è┘ ╪ذ┘┘╪│ ╪د┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز.\",\"en\":\"We built a full admin dashboard that unifies the platformظآs operations: manage enterprises and branches, onboard\\/approve doctors, schedule appointments, track attendance, moderate reviews, generate invoices, run ads, and handle support plus APIs so the patient\\/doctor mobile experience stays in sync.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪┤╪ت╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘╪▒┘ê╪╣\", \"en\": \"Enterprise & Branch Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘è╪د╪»╪د╪ز/╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪┤┘┘è╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Create and manage clinics/hospitals (enterprises)\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪»╪╣┘à ┘╪▒┘ê╪╣ ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر ┘┘â┘ ┘à┘╪┤╪ث╪ر\", \"en\": \"Multi-branch support per enterprise\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ش╪»╪د┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪î ╪ح╪╕┘ç╪د╪▒/╪ح┘è┘é╪د┘ ╪د┘┘à┘╪┤╪ث╪ر╪î ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘ê╪▒\", \"en\": \"Working schedules, visibility controls (hide/stop), and media files\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Doctors Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ث╪╖╪ذ╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪«╪╡╪╡╪د╪ز ┘ê╪▒╪ذ╪╖┘ç┘à ╪ذ╪د┘┘à┘╪┤╪ت╪ز\", \"en\": \"Do