┘╪╣╪▒╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ح┘╪ش┘┘è╪▓┘è╪ر.\",\"en\":\"EasyList is a web system built for businesses that run on freelancers and sales agents. It provides a full admin dashboard to manage clients, freelancers, orders, and transfers with affiliate marketing, role-based financial reports, franchise management, user permissions, and an educational library fully supporting Arabic and English.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪د┘╪┤╪▒┘â╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘┘è ╪ذ╪ز╪┤╪ز╪║┘ ┘à╪╣ ┘à╪│╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ┘ê┘ê┘â┘╪د╪ة ┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز ╪║╪د┘╪ذ┘ï╪د ╪ذ╪ز┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç:\\r\\n\\r\\n╪ز╪┤╪ز╪ز ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ╪ذ┘è┘ ┘à┘┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ح┘â╪│┘ ┘ê╪»┘╪د╪ز╪▒\\r\\n╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘╪ص┘ê╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪ص┘é╪د╪ز\\r\\n╪║┘è╪د╪ذ ╪▒╪ج┘è╪ر ┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د╪╢╪ص╪ر ┘┘â┘ ╪»┘ê╪▒ (┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز╪î ┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر╪î ┘à╪»┘è╪▒ ┘à╪د┘┘è╪î CEO)\\r\\n╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ╪ز┘╪╕┘è┘à ╪د┘╪ز╪│┘ê┘è┘é ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘╪ر ┘ê╪┤╪ش╪▒╪ر ╪ح╪ص╪د┘╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة\\r\\n╪╢╪╣┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘┘è ╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز ╪ذ┘è┘ ╪د┘┘╪▒┘è┘é ┘ê╪د┘┘╪▒╪د┘╪┤╪د┘è╪▓\",\"en\":\"Companies working with freelancers and sales agents often struggle with:\\r\\n\\r\\nScattered client and freelancer data across Excel sheets and files\\r\\nHard-to-track orders, transfers, and dues\\r\\nNo clear financial visibility per role (Sales, HR, Finance, CEO)\\r\\nComplex affiliate marketing and client referral trees\\r\\nWeak access control across teams and franchise partners\"}','{\"ar\":\"EasyList ╪ذ┘è╪ش┘à╪╣ ┘â┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ┘┘è ┘à┘╪╡╪ر ┘ê╪د╪ص╪»╪ر: ╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز╪î ╪ز╪ز╪ذ╪╣ ╪د┘╪ص┘ê╪د┘╪د╪ز╪î ╪د┘╪ز╪│┘ê┘è┘é ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘╪ر╪î ╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪ز┘╪╡┘è┘┘è╪ر╪î ╪د┘┘╪▒╪د┘╪┤╪د┘è╪▓╪î ╪د┘╪ث╪»┘ê╪د╪▒ ┘ê╪د┘╪╡┘╪د╪ص┘è╪د╪ز╪î ┘ê╪د┘╪ش╪▒╪» ╪╣╪┤╪د┘ ╪د┘┘é╪▒╪د╪▒ ┘è╪ذ┘é┘ë ╪ث╪│╪▒╪╣ ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪┤╪║┘è┘ ╪ث┘ê╪╢╪ص.\",\"en\":\"EasyList unifies operations in one platform: freelancers, clients, orders, transfers, affiliate marketing, detailed financial reporting, franchises, roles & permissions, and inventory so teams move faster with clearer visibility.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘é┘┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Freelancer Management\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╢╪د┘╪ر ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ┘ê╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪د┘╪╢┘à╪د┘à\", \"en\": \"Add and manage freelancers and join requests\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪╡┘┘è┘ ┘à╪ش╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ (╪▒╪خ┘è╪│┘è╪ر ┘ê┘╪▒╪╣┘è╪ر)\", \"en\": \"Main and sub work-field categorization\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é┘è┘è┘à ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘é┘┘è┘ ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ح╪ش╪د╪▓╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Freelancer ratings and holiday tracking\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪د╪│╪ز┘è╪▒╪د╪» ┘ê╪ز╪╡╪»┘è╪▒ ╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز┘é┘┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Import/export freelancer data\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Clients & Orders\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘â╪د┘à┘╪ر ┘╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Full client data management\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح┘╪┤╪د╪ة ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪╖┘╪ذ╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Create and track orders\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ز╪│╪ش┘è┘ ╪د┘╪ص┘ê╪د┘╪د╪ز ┘ê╪ذ┘è╪د┘╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘ê┘è┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪ح┘à┘â╪د┘┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘à┘è┘\", \"en\": \"Record transfers and transfer data with download support\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز╪│┘ê┘è┘é ╪ذ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘╪ر\", \"en\": \"Affiliate Marketing\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ح╪│┘╪د╪» ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘ê┘à╪ز╪د╪ذ╪╣╪ر ╪د┘╪ح╪ص╪د┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Client assignment and referral tracking\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪╣╪▒╪╢ ╪┤╪ش╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة\", \"en\": \"Client tree visualization\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪ح╪╣╪»╪د╪»╪د╪ز ┘╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘ê┘╪ر\", \"en\": \"Commission settings management\"}]}, {\"title\": {\"ar\": \"╪د┘╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪د┘┘à╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘┘è┘╪د╪ز\", \"en\": \"Financial Reports & Analytics\"}, \"points\": [{\"ar\": \"╪ز┘é╪د╪▒┘è╪▒ ╪ص╪│╪ذ ╪د┘╪»┘ê╪▒ (┘à╪ذ┘è╪╣╪د╪ز╪î ┘à┘ê╪د╪▒╪» ╪ذ╪┤╪▒┘è╪ر╪î ┘à╪»┘è╪▒ ┘┘┘è╪î ┘à╪»┘è╪▒ ┘à╪د┘┘è╪î CEO)\", \"en\": \"Role-based reports (Sales, HR, Technical Director, Finance, CEO)\"}, {\"ar\": \"╪▒╪│┘ê┘à ╪ذ┘è╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘