INSERT INTO `services` VALUES (1,'{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╖┘ê┘è╪▒ ╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘ê┘è╪ذ\",\"en\":\"Web Application Development\"}','web-application-development','{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê┘è╪ذ ┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر ┘à╪ذ┘┘è╪ر ╪ذ┘ Laravel ┘êReact ┘ê╪ث╪╖╪▒ ╪ص╪»┘è╪س╪ر ┘┘╪ث╪»╪د╪ة ┘ê╪د┘┘é╪د╪ذ┘┘è╪ر ┘┘╪ز┘ê╪│╪╣.\",\"en\":\"Custom web apps built with Laravel, React, and modern frameworks for performance and scalability.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘╪ذ┘┘è ╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ┘ê┘è╪ذ ┘é┘ê┘è╪ر ┘à╪╡┘à┘à╪ر ┘ê┘┘é ╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ╪╣┘à┘┘â. ┘à┘ ┘┘ê╪ص╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ╪د┘╪»╪د╪«┘┘è╪ر ╪ح┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à┘ê╪ش┘ç╪ر ┘┘╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة╪î ┘è┘é╪»┘à ┘╪▒┘è┘é┘╪د ╪ص┘┘ê┘╪د┘ï ╪ت┘à┘╪ر ┘ê┘é╪د╪ذ┘╪ر ┘┘╪ز┘ê╪│╪╣ ╪ذ╪د╪│╪ز╪«╪»╪د┘à Laravel ┘êVue.js ┘êReact ┘ê╪د┘╪ذ┘┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪│╪ص╪د╪ذ┘è╪ر.\",\"en\":\"We build robust web applications tailored to your business processes. From internal dashboards to customer-facing platforms, our team delivers secure, scalable solutions using Laravel, Vue.js, React, and cloud infrastructure.\"}','{\"ar\": [\"╪ز╪╖┘ê┘è╪▒ API\", \"┘┘ê╪ص╪د╪ز ╪ز╪ص┘â┘à ┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر\", \"╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ╪ث┘╪╕┘à╪ر ERP\", \"╪ث┘à╪د┘ ╪╣┘┘ë ┘à╪│╪ز┘ê┘ë ╪د┘┘à╪ج╪│╪│╪د╪ز\"], \"en\": [\"API Development\", \"Custom Dashboards\", \"ERP Integration\", \"Enterprise Security\"]}','{\"ar\": [\"╪╣┘à┘┘è╪د╪ز ┘è╪»┘ê┘è╪ر ╪ذ╪╖┘è╪خ╪ر\", \"╪ث┘╪╕┘à╪ر ┘é╪»┘è┘à╪ر ╪║┘è╪▒ ┘à╪ز╪╡┘╪ر\", \"╪╡╪╣┘ê╪ذ╪ر ╪د┘╪ز┘ê╪│╪╣\"], \"en\": [\"Slow manual processes\", \"Disconnected legacy systems\", \"Scaling difficulties\"]}','code',NULL,1,'published',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-30 17:49:36','2026-08-30 17:49:36',NULL),(2,'{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╖┘ê┘è╪▒ ╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪ش┘ê╪د┘\",\"en\":\"Mobile App Development\"}','mobile-app-development','{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪ش┘ê╪د┘ ╪ث╪╡┘┘è╪ر ┘ê┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪د╪ز ┘┘ iOS ┘êAndroid ┘è╪ص╪ذ┘ç╪د ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à┘ê┘.\",\"en\":\"Native and cross-platform mobile apps for iOS and Android that users love.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ز┘ê╪د╪╡┘ ┘à╪╣ ╪╣┘à┘╪د╪خ┘â ╪ث┘è┘┘à╪د ┘â╪د┘┘ê╪د ╪╣╪ذ╪▒ ╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز ╪ش┘ê╪د┘ ┘à╪╡┘à┘à╪ر ╪ذ╪╣┘╪د┘è╪ر. ┘╪╖┘ê╪▒ ╪ز╪╖╪ذ┘è┘é╪د╪ز iOS\\/Android ╪ث╪╡┘┘è╪ر ┘ê╪ص┘┘ê┘╪د┘ï ┘à╪ز╪╣╪»╪»╪ر ╪د┘┘à┘╪╡╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪د╪│╪ز╪«╪»╪د┘à Flutter ┘êReact Native.\",\"en\":\"Reach your customers wherever they are with beautifully designed mobile applications. We develop native iOS\\/Android apps and cross-platform solutions using Flutter and React Native.\"}',NULL,NULL,'smartphone',NULL,1,'published',2,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-30 17:49:36','2026-08-30 17:49:36',NULL),(3,'{\"ar\":\"╪ص┘┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪ز╪ش╪د╪▒╪ر ╪د┘╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر\",\"en\":\"E-Commerce Solutions\"}','e-commerce-solutions','{\"ar\":\"┘à╪ز╪د╪ش╪▒ ╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر ┘à╪╣ ╪»┘╪╣ ╪│┘╪│ ┘ê╪ح╪»╪د╪▒╪ر ┘à╪«╪▓┘ê┘ ┘ê╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘ ╪ذ┘ê╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪»┘╪╣.\",\"en\":\"Online stores with seamless checkout, inventory management, and payment integration.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪ث╪╖┘┘é ┘ê┘┘à┘ّ┘ ╪ث╪╣┘à╪د┘┘â ╪د┘╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر ╪ذ┘à┘╪╡╪د╪ز ╪ز╪ش╪د╪▒╪ر ╪ح┘┘â╪ز╪▒┘ê┘┘è╪ر ┘à╪«╪╡╪╡╪ر. ┘╪»┘à╪ش ╪ذ┘ê╪د╪ذ╪د╪ز ╪د┘╪»┘╪╣ ┘ê┘à╪▓┘ê╪»┘è ╪د┘╪┤╪ص┘ ┘ê╪ث┘╪╕┘à╪ر ERP ┘╪ص┘ ╪ز╪ش╪▓╪خ╪ر ┘à╪ز┘â╪د┘à┘.\",\"en\":\"Launch and grow your online business with custom e-commerce platforms. We integrate payment gateways, shipping providers, and ERP systems for a complete retail solution.\"}',NULL,NULL,'shopping-cart',NULL,1,'published',3,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-30 17:49:36','2026-08-30 17:49:36',NULL),(4,'{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╡┘à┘è┘à UI\\/UX\",\"en\":\"UI\\/UX Design\"}','uiux-design','{\"ar\":\"╪ز╪╡┘à┘è┘à ┘è╪▒┘â╪▓ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à ┘è╪ص┘ê┘ّ┘ ╪د┘╪▓┘ê╪د╪▒ ╪ح┘┘ë ╪╣┘à┘╪د╪ة ┘à╪«┘╪╡┘è┘.\",\"en\":\"User-centered design that converts visitors into loyal customers.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘è╪╡┘╪╣ ┘╪▒┘è┘é ╪د┘╪ز╪╡┘à┘è┘à ┘╪»┘è┘╪د ┘ê╪د╪ش┘ç╪د╪ز ╪ذ╪»┘è┘ç┘è╪ر ┘à╪»╪╣┘ê┘à╪ر ╪ذ╪ث╪ذ╪ص╪د╪س ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à ┘ê╪د┘┘┘à╪د╪░╪ش ╪د┘╪ث┘ê┘┘è╪ر. ┘╪╢┘à┘ ╪ث┘ ┘â┘ ╪ز┘╪د╪╣┘ ┘è╪╣┘â╪│ ╪╣┘╪د┘à╪ز┘â ┘ê┘è┘╪ذ┘è ╪ز┘ê┘é╪╣╪د╪ز ╪د┘┘à╪│╪ز╪«╪»┘à.\",\"en\":\"Our design team creates intuitive interfaces backed by user research, wireframing, and prototyping. We ensure every interaction reflects your brand and meets user expectations.\"}',NULL,NULL,'palette',NULL,0,'published',4,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-30 17:49:36','2026-08-30 17:49:36',NULL),(5,'{\"ar\":\"╪د┘╪│╪ص╪د╪ذ╪ر ┘êDevOps\",\"en\":\"Cloud & DevOps\"}','cloud-devops','{\"ar\":\"╪ذ┘┘è╪ر AWS ┘êAzure ┘ê╪«╪╖┘ê╪╖ CI\\/CD ┘ê┘à╪▒╪د┘é╪ذ╪ر ┘à╪│╪ز┘à╪▒╪ر.\",\"en\":\"AWS and Azure infrastructure setup, CI\\/CD pipelines, and monitoring.\"}','{\"ar\":\"╪د┘╪ز┘é┘ ╪ح┘┘ë ╪د┘╪│╪ص╪د╪ذ╪ر ╪ذ╪س┘é╪ر. ┘╪╡┘à┘à ┘ê┘┘╪┤╪▒ ┘ê┘╪ص╪د┘╪╕ ╪╣┘┘ë ╪د┘╪ذ┘┘è╪ر ╪د┘╪│╪ص╪د╪ذ┘è╪ر ┘à╪╣ ╪«╪╖┘ê╪╖ ╪ت┘┘è╪ر ┘ê┘à╪▒╪د┘é╪ذ╪ر ┘ê╪«╪╖╪╖ ╪د╪│╪ز╪▒╪»╪د╪» ┘à┘ ╪د┘┘â┘ê╪د╪▒╪س.\",\"en\":\"Migrate to the cloud with confidence. We architect, deploy, and maintain cloud infrastructure with automated pipelines, monitoring, and disaster recovery planning.\"}',NULL,NULL,'cloud',NULL,0,'published',5,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-30 17:49:36','2026-08-30 17:49:36',NULL),(6,'{\"ar\":\"╪د╪│╪ز╪┤╪د╪▒╪د╪ز ╪ز┘é┘┘è╪ر\",\"en\":\"IT Consulting\"}','it-consulting','{\"ar\":\"╪ح╪▒╪┤╪د╪» ╪ز┘é┘┘è ╪د╪│╪ز╪▒╪د╪ز┘è╪ش┘è ┘┘à┘ê╪د╪ة┘à╪ر ╪د╪│╪ز╪س┘à╪د╪▒╪د╪ز IT ┘à╪╣ ╪ث┘ç╪»╪د┘ ╪د┘╪╣┘à┘.\",\"en\":\"Strategic technology guidance to align IT investments with business goals.\"}','{\"ar\":\"┘╪│╪ز ┘à╪ز╪ث┘â╪»╪د┘ï ┘à┘ ╪ث┘è┘ ╪ز╪ذ╪»╪ث╪ا ┘è┘é┘è┘ّ┘à ┘à╪│╪ز╪┤╪د╪▒┘ê┘╪د ╪ث┘╪╕┘à╪ز┘â ╪د┘╪ص╪د┘┘è╪ر ┘ê┘è╪ص╪»╪»┘ê┘ ╪د┘┘╪▒╪╡ ┘ê┘è╪╢╪╣┘ê┘ ╪«╪▒╪د╪خ╪╖ ╪╖╪▒┘è┘é ╪ز┘é┘┘è╪ر ┘é╪د╪ذ┘╪ر ┘┘╪ز┘┘┘è╪░ ┘┘╪ز╪ص┘ê┘ ╪د┘╪▒┘é┘à┘è.\",\"en\":\"Not sure where to start? Our consultants assess your current systems, identify opportunities, and create actionable technology roadmaps for digital transformation.\"}',NULL,NULL,'briefcase',NULL,0,'published',6,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-30 17:49:36','2026-08-30 17:49:36',NULL);
